<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Liholu lya Lagiru</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Liholu lya lagiru</para>
  <para style="toc2">Liholu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Liho</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">LIHOLU LYA LAGIRU</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha lagiru ndo mawungiru ga Lagiru ga shitabu sha Wapentikosti, Vitabu vya kwanja mhanu vya lipatanu Ligona. Shiebrania shitabu ashi mana yakuyi, Shisoweru Kwa vyoseri tujimira handa Musa kalembiti shitabu sha Liholu lya Lagiru. Ira hera Upeleru wa kuhowa kwakuyi. Shitabu ashi shanjira kwa kulonga handa. Avi ndo visoweru vya Musa kwa Waisraeli woseri. Liholu lya Musa ndo handa mlemba gwa Liholu ga Lagiru na viraa kuhimiziya shaka shoseri, vidoda vyoseri vyavifira kulawira Mulipatanu lya Syayi. Mfanu gwa kwanja mumatendu 3:22-23 peni petelu kawuyira Liholu ga Lagiru, mifanu imonga handa lyanjiru, kulawa, Walawi na Walanga kwanjira 1300 ama 1400 vinja B.C Liholu lya Lagiru lilembitwi handa lifundu pakati pa mfalumi na ukolamlima wakuyi, ntambu yaiyitendikiti pa Mlungu na wantu wa Israeli Mlungu wajimira kulaviya tekelera zakuyi kwa wantu yawafata Lagiru zakuyi, wana wa Israeli yawajimira ndiri lagiru za Mlungu, Hawazibiwi. Aga ndo matendu ga shitabu ashi kumbiti shipandi sha 27 na 28 ashi shihimiziya tekelera za gweka na malawiru ga pangira kulawa wana wa Israeli yawajimira ndiri. Makabila ga gweka mawili ga Israeli gagolokiti wega mbili, pagweka shaka pawawalanga tekelera azi pamuhera na pangira za kila yumu kwa Liziwu su kujimira lipatanu lyawu.</para>
  <para style="iot">YAGAWERAAMU</para>
  <para style="io">Mushipandi sha 1 mpaka 3 Musa kayowelera shintu gaa shirawiriti shaka sha mwanja gwa Waisraeli mpaka kushiwala.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha 4 mpaka 26 Shiyowelera vintu vya mapatanu pakati pa Mlungu na wantu wakuyi.</para>
  <para style="io">Viraa mushipandi sha 27-30 Waisraeli wayoweleriti tekera na pangira kwa kubota kulanguziya handa mapatanu ndo ganakaka.</para>
  <para style="io">Upeleru mushipandi 31 mpaka 24 Musa katakuliriti visoweru vya upeleru kwa Yoshuwa na kila likabila lya Israeli pamberi pa kuhowa.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s">Visoweru vya kwanja vya Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Avi ndo visoweru Musa vyakawagambiriti Waisraeli woseri pawaweriti kuntundu kwakulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani. Womberi wanyawiti malingu gawu mulularanda lwa Yoridani pakwegera na sufu, pakati pa mji gwa Parani uwega gumu na mji gwa Tofeli na Labani na Hazeroti na Dizahabu uwega gumonga. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Kutyanga kulawa lugongu Sinayi kugenda Kadeshibaneya, wantu waweza kugenda mwanja kwa mashaka lilongu na yimu, kwa kupitira njira ya lugongu Seiri. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Mulishaka lya kwanja muwezi gwa lilongu na yimu, mushinja sha malongu na msheshi pa kulawa Misri, Musa kawagambiriti Waisraeli kila shintu shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakamlagaliriti kawagambiri womberi. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Musa katenditi hangu pakamkomiti kala na kumkanka Sihoni mfalumi gwa Waamori, ulii yakaweriti kankulikala mumji gwa Heshiboni pamuhera na Ogu mfalumi gwa Bashani, ulii yakaweriti kankulikala mji gwa Ashitaroti na mji gwa Edireyi. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Waisraeli pawaweriti wankali muisi ya Wamowabu uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani, Musa kanjiti kugatakulira malagaliru pamuhera na mafundu ga Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 1:5">Yomberi kawagambiriti, <verse eid="DEU 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />twenga patuweriti kulugongu Sinayi, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu katugambiriti, mwenga mulikala mulugongu alu kwa shaka shitangara. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Su vinu mwenga mtupuli malingu genu na mwendereyi na mwanja. Mgendi muisi yawalikala Waamori na mumikowa yoseri ya pakwegera, mulularanda lwa Yoridani muisi ya vigongu muluseleru lwa vigongu kwaguzyeta mshenji, aku Negebu mulularanda lwa kumpwani. Mgendi muisi yawalikala Wakanaani na isi ya Lebanoni mpaka kulushemba lukulu lwa Eufrati. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Mloli, neni niwapanani mwenga isi ayi. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu, nuwalagiliti kuwapanana wambuyi wenu Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakubu pamuhera na shiyuwuku shawu. Su vinu mgendi mwakaitoli kwa makakala na muikali isi ilii.<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kankuwasyagula wakulu wa kumtanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Musa kawagambiriti wantu, twenga patuweriti twankali kulugongu Sinayi, neni niwagambiriti, lihengu lya kuwalongoziya mwenga liwera likulu ng'anji kwa neni. Hapeni ntendi gweka yangu. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, kawatenda mwenga muweri wavuwa gambira ntondu za kulyela. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwa wambuyi wetu, kawatendi mwenga kuwera wavuwa mala elufu kuliku ntambu yamuwera vinu na kawatekeleri ntambu yakalagiliti. <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Kumbiti neni gweka yangu hawezi hashi lihengu ali likulu lya kuwakolaniziya mwenga mwawoseri? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Mwenga msyaguli wapalu yawawera na luhala na umana na yakagoheleluwa kulawa mukila likabila su waweri wakulu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Mwenga munankuliti, shitwatila shagutakula ndo shiherepa kwa twenga kushitenda. <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Su nuwashemiti pamuhera wapalu yawaweriti na luhala na umana na yawagoheleluwa, walii yawasyagulituwiti kulawa mumakabila genu, nuwatuliti kuwera wakulu wenu. Wamu wawu waweriti wakulu wa wantu elufu na wamonga wakulu kwa miya na wamonga wakulu kwa wantu malongu muhanu na wamonga waweriti wakulu kwa wantu lilongu.<verse eid="DEU 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />Shaka shilaa shilii, niwagambiriti wakulu wenu, mpikaniri masitaka ga wantu wenu pamuhera na masitaka ga wahenga yawalikala pakati penu. Mtozi teratera, <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />mwenga namumpendereya muntu yoseri muutoza wenu. Mpikaniri masitaka ga walii yawawera wahushu ntambu yampikanira masitaka ga walunda. Namumtira muntu yoseri pakakalala, toziya utoza yamtoza ilawa kwa Mlungu. Sitaka lyoseri palikamala kwa mwenga, su mulijegi kulongolu kwaneni hantozi. <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Shaka shilaa shilii, nuwalagaliriti vitwatira vyoseri vyamfiruwa kutenda.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kankuwatuma walolalola wa bada</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Mawalanga 13:1-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />Shakapanu twenga tutenditi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu tambu yakatulagaliriti. Twanjiti mwanja kuwuka mulugongu Sinayi na tugenditi mwanja kupitira mushiwala shikulu na sha kutiriziya shamushiwoniti, kugendera njira yaigenda muisi ya vigongu vya Waamori. Patusokiti Kadeshibarineya, <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />neni niwagambiriti, vinu mwenga msoka muisi ya vigongu vya Waamori, isi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu katupanana. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Mloli, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu katupanana twenga isi ayi. Su mgendi na kuitola kwa makakala gambira Mtuwa Mlungu gwa wambuyi wetu ntambu yakawalagiliti kutupanana. Namtira! Namshashatika.<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />Kumbiti mwawoseri mwenga mwiziti kwaneni na kulonga, pamberi pakugenda, tuwatumi wapalu wamu kulii wakaloliloli kwa bada isi ilii, su womberi pawawuya hawatugambiri njira iherepa kwa twenga kugenda kulii na miji ya kulii ilifana ntambu gaa.<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />Shitwatira ashi shiwonekiti kuwera shiherepa kwaneni, su nuwasyaguliti wantu lilongu na mbili, muntu yumu kulawa mukila likabila. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Womberi wagenditi muisi iliii ya vigongu, wasokiti kululalanda lwa Eshikoli na waluloliti loliti kwa bada. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Pawawuyiti womberi watujegeriti mabwajubwaju gamu ga isi ilii na watugambiriti kuwera isi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu wetu upanana, iherepa nentu.<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />Kumbiti mwenga mjimira ndiri lilagaliru lya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kugenda muisi ilii. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Muhinginikiti mumalingu genu pamlonga, Mtuwa Mlungu katukalalira, su katulaviyiti Misri, kavilekeziyiti vipinga vya Waamori vitwagamiziyi. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Iwera hashi twenga tugendi kulii? Twenga tutira. Wapalu yatuwatumiti kulii watugambiriti kuwera wantu yawalikala kulii wawera makakala na watalipa nentu kuliku twenga, viraa walikala mumiji yaiwera na vibambaza vitalipa mpaka kulyera. Kayi walongiti kuwera wawoniti mikambaku shiyuwuku sha Anaki.<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />Shakapanu nenu niwagambiriti mwenga, namshashatika, namuwatira wantu walii. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawalongolera, Mlungu mweni hakaweri uwega wetu kuwakomanga wankondu wenu ntambu yakatenditi kulongolu kwenu kulii Misri <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />na kushiwala kulii. Mwenga mwoniti Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu ntambu yakawalongoleriti mwenga, gambira tati ntambu yakamlolera weri mwana gwakuwi, munjira yoseri yamgenditi mpaka mwenga msokiti pahala panu. <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Kumbiti ata panongiti goseri aga, mwenga mumjimiriti ndiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />ulii yakawalongoleriti, pashiru kawalongoleriti kwa motu kuwalunguziya njira yamuigendera na paluwala kawalongoleriti kwa lihundu lilii su kuwasakulila pahala paherepa pa kunyawa malingu genu.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Mlungu kankuwazibu Waisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakapikaniriti shilii shamlongiti, su kakalariti, kalirapiti pakalonga, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />kwahera ata yumu gwenu mushiyuwuku ashi shikontola hakagendi kwingira muisi ilii iherepa yanuwalagiliti kuwapanana wambuyi wenu, <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />kumbiti Karebu mwana gwa Yefuni ndo hakingiri. Neni hanimpanani isi ayi yakayilolitiloliti kwa bada iweri yakuwi pamuhera na shiyuwuku shakuwi toziya kawera mwaminika nentu kulongolu kwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Toziya ya mwenga, Mtuwa Mlungu kankalalariti na kalongiti, ata gwenga hapeni gwingiri muisi ilii. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Kumbiti mtanga gwaku Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni, ndo hakawalongoziyi Waisraeli kwingira muisi ilii. Su gumgangamaziyi toziya yomberi hakawalongoziyi Waisraeli kuyitola kwa makakala isi ilii.<verse eid="DEU 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu katugambira twawoseri twenga, mwenga mtakula kuwera wana wenu wadidi hawatolowi kwa makakala na wangondu wenu. Toziya womberi hawenikuli, wavimana ndiri vitwatira viherepa na virii vikondora. Kumbiti womberi ndo walii yang'enda kuwapanana isi ilii, hawingiri na kuhala. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Kumbiti mwenga, mgalambuki na kuwuya kushiwala kulola ku Bahari ya Shamu.<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />Shakapanu wambuyi wenu wanankuliti, twenga tutenda vidoda, tumjimira ndiri Mtuwa Mlungu. Twenga hatugendi muisi ilii na kulikomanga ngondu gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatulagaliriti. Kila mpalu pakati pawu katoliti silaha yakuwi, waliholiti kuwera hayiweri rahisi kuitola kwa makakala isi ilii ya vigongu.<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti, guwaberiziyi nawakwena kugenda kulikomanga muisi ilii, toziya neni hapeni weri pamuhera na womberi, wangondu wawu hawawagamiziyi kwa kuwakomanga. <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Su neni niwagambiriti aga, kumbiti womberi walemiti shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakatugambiriti, womberi wingiriti pota kulishera muisi ilii ya vigongu. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Shakapanu Waamori yawalikaliti muisi ya vigongu virii wasulukiti na kuwawinga gambira wanjuki. Wawawingiti na kuwakomanga kulawa aku Seiri mpaka Horima.<verse eid="DEU 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Su wambuyi wetu wawuyiti na kumlilila Mtuwa Mlungu, kumbiti yomberi kawapikaniriti ndiri ama kuwashera. <verse eid="DEU 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />Su tusigaliti kulikala aku Kadeshibarineya kwa shaka shitangala.<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankuyerayera kushiwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Shakapanu tugalambukiti na kugenda mwanja kushiwala kulola uwega wa ku Bahari ya Shamu gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatugambiriti, twenga tuyeritiyeriti pakwegera na lugongu Seiri kwa shaka shitangala.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />Mwenga muyerayera muisi ayi ya lugongu kwa shaka shitangara, vinu mgalambuki kugenda kushana. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Guwagambiri wantu malagizu aga. Mwapakwegera kupita muisi ya vigongu ya Seiri, isi ya walongu wenu shiyuwuku sha Esawu. Womberi hawawatiri, pamuhera na hangu muliloli weri namuwakomanga. <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />Namuwagaziya womberi toziya hapeni niwapanani semu muisi yawu. Hapeni niwapanani ata pahala padidini pa kutimbanga ligulu. Isi ayi ya vigongu ya Seiri nuwapananiti shiyuwuku sha Esawu iweri yawu. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Mwenga muhemeri shiboga kulawa kwawu pamuhera na mashi ga kuranda.<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, kakutekelera mukila shintu shagutenditi. Kawalolera weri pamuyeritiyerit mushiwala ashi shikulu. Kaweriti pamuhera na mwenga muvinja ayi malongu msheshi na muweriti na kila shintu shamfiriti.<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />Su twenga twendereyiti na mwanja, tupititi muisi ya walongu wetu shiyuwuku sha Esawu yawalikaliti Seiri, tuilekiti njira yaigenda Araba, njira yailawiti Elati na Ezioni Geberi. Tugalambukiti kugenda njira yaigenda uwega wa kushiwala sha Mowabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti, naguwagaziya wantu wa Mowabu, ama nagulikomanga ngondu nawu toziya hapeni niwapanani semu yoseri muisi yawu. Muisi ya Ari nuwapananiti womberi wa shiyuwuku sha Lutu iweri yawu.<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />Pamakashu wantu yawaweriti na makakala na watalipa ng'anji gambira Waanaki walikaliti muisi ya Ari. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Gambira Waanaki ntambu yawawera, wantu awa wamanikaniti kuwera Warefai, kumbiti Wamowabu wawashemiti Waemi. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Kwanja Wahori walikaliti Seiri, kumbiti shiyuwuku sha Esawu shiwawingiti na kuwagamiziya. Shakapanu shiyuwuku sha Esawu shilikaliti muisi ilii. Waisraeli watenditi ntambu iraa ilii kuwawinga wantu wa Kanaani, Mtuwa Mlungu pakawapananiti iweri isi yawu.<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />Musa kendereyiti kutakula, Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu katugambiriti, Muwuki vinu, mloki lushemba Zeredi. Su twenga tulokiti lushemba Zeredi. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Gapititi mivinja malongu matatu na nani kwanjira tulawiti Kadeshi Barineya mpaka kuloka lushemba lwa Zeredi. Shaka shilii shiyuwuku sha wapalu yawawera na umuli gwa kugenda kulikomanga ngondu wagamiziwituwiti gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalirapiriti kuwera mewagamiziwi. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Mtuwa Mlungu kendereyiti kuwazibu na kuwalaga womberi mpaka pawahowiti woseri.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />Su wantu wa shileri shilii pawahowiti kala, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />leru hamloki mumbaka wa Wamowabu kwa kupitira isi ya Ari. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Mwenga pamwingira muisi ya Waamoni, shiyuwuku sha Lutu, namuwagaziya ama kulikomanga ngondu nawu, hapeni niwapanani semu muisi yawu toziya niwapanani isi iweri uhala wawu.<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Isi ayi imanikana viraa handa isi ya Warefayi. Pamakashu Warefayi walikaliti amu, Waamoni wawashemiti womberi Wazamzumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Wazamzumi waweriti wantu wavuwa na yawawera na makakala na watalipa nentu gambira Waanaki. Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kawagamiziyiti, su Waamori waweziti kulikala muisi yawu. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu katenditi ntambu yakawatendiriti Waedomu shiyuwuku sha Esawu, shilii shalikaliti Seiri. Kawagamiziyiti Wahori shaka Waedomu pawasokiti kulii na waitoliti isi yawu na wanjiti kulikala kulii. Shiyuwuku sha Esawu shankulikala kulii mpaka leru. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Shintu shilaa shilii shilawiriti kwa Waavi, walii yawalikaliti mushisiwa shashiwera mumbwega mwa bahari ya Meditereniya uwega wa kusika wa Gaza. Wantu yawalawiti mushisiwa sha Kireti yawashemituwiti Wakafitori, wawagamiziyiti Waavi na kulikala muisi ilii badala yawu.<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />Musa kendereyiti kulonga, shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti, vinu mwanji mwanja! Mloki lularanda lwa Arinoni. Neni hanuwatangi kumkanka Sihoni mfalumi gwa Waamori wa aku Heshiboni na neni haniwapanani mwenga isi yakuwi. Mwakamkangali mfalumi ayu na kuitola kwa makakala isi yakuwi. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Kwanjira leru hanyanji kuwatenda wantu kila pahala wawatiri mwenga. Womberi pawavipikanira visoweru vyenu, su hawashashatiki kwa lyoga.<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankuitola kwa makakala isi ya mfalumi Sihoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />Musa kawagambiriti Waisraeli, shakapanu neni ntumiti wajumbi kulawa kushiwala Kedemoti wagendi kwa mfalumi Sihoni gwa aku Heshiboni pawawera na visoweru avi vya ponga wakamgambiri, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />gutulekeziyi kupiti muisi yaku, hatupiti munjira nkulu pota na kugalambuka kumliwu ama kumshigi. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Gutushuwuziri shiboga pamuhera na mashi ga kuranda. Twenga shatuluwa gutulekeziyi kupita muisi yaku, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />tuloki lushemba Yoridani na kwingira muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakagenda kutupanana. Shiyuwuku sha Esawu shashilikala Seiri na shiyuwuku sha Mowabu shashilikala Ari, womberi watulekeziyiti viraa kupita muisi zawu.<verse eid="DEU 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Kumbiti mfalumi Sihoni gwa aku Heshiboni katulekeziyiti ndiri tupiti muisi yakuwi, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenditi mfalumi pamuhera na wantu wakuwi waweri na mtiti na moyu gukamala, su tuwakanki na kutola isi yawu ilii yatuikolamlima mpaka vinu.<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />Sakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti, guloli, nanja kumtenda mfalumi Sihoni pamuhera na isi yakuwi mumkanki. Mwanji kuitola kwa makakala isi yakuwi na kulikala. <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Su mfalumi Sihoni pamuhera na shonta lyakuyi pakatwiziriti kulikomanga ngondu na twenga mumji gwa Jahazi, <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, katupananiti uwezu wa kuwakanka womberi, su twenga tumlagiti Sihoni na wana wakuwi pamuhera na wantu wakuwi woseri. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Twenga tuikangaliti miji yakuwi yoseri na kuyagamiziya nakamu yoseri, tuwalagiti wapalu na wadala pamuhera na wana, tumlekiti ndiri muntu yoseri kalikali. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Tutoliti vintu vyaviweriti mumiji ilii yatuikangaliti, viraa tutoliti na mifugu yawu. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Kulawa Aroeri mji yaguwera mumbega mwa lularanda lwa Arinoni na mji yauwera muliranda ali mpaka Gileyadi, kuweriti ndiri na mji yaguweriti vibambaza vitalipa na makakala kwa twenga kutukanka. Mtuwa Mlungu katutenditi twenga tuikanki miji yoseri. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Kumbiti tusegeriti ndiri isi ya Waamoni na mumbwega mwa lushemba Yaboki na mumiji ya isi ya vigongu na semu yoseri ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakatuleweriti kugenda.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Wisraeli wamkanka Ogu mfalumi gwa Bashani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Mawalanga 21:31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />Musa kawagambiriti Waisraeli, Twenga tugalambukiti kugenda kushana mumji gwa Bashani, mfalumi Ogu kiziti pamuhera na wanjagira wakuwi kulikomanga ngondu na twenga aku mumji gwa Edireyi. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti, nagumtira toziya hanulutendi shonta lyaku kumkanka yomberi pamuhera na shonta lyakuyi lyoseri na kuitola kwa makakala miji yawu. Mwenga hamumtendi mfalumi ayu ntambu yamumtenditi Sihoni mfalumi gwa Waamori yakalikaliti kulii Heshiboni.<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu katutenditi twenga tumkanki mfalumi Ogu pamuhera na shonta lyakuyi lyoseri, tuwalagiti woseri, tumlekiti ndiri muntu yoseri kalikali. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Mushaka shilii twenga tuitoliti miji yakuwi yoseri, kuweriti ndiri ata mji gumu yatugulekiti kuutola kwa makakala. Miji yoseri yatuitoliti kwa makakala iweriti malongu sita, enewu lyoseri lya Arigobu, mji gulii yagukolituwitimlima na mfalumi Ogu gwa Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Miji yoseri ayi iweriti na vibambaza vitalipa kugenda kumpindi na guweriti na magomi na vitatiru. Viraa kuweriti na vijiji vivuwa vyavizengekiwituwiti ndiri na vibambaza. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Twenga twagamiziyiti nakamu kila shintu ntambu yatwagamiziyiti muisi ilii mfalumi Sihoni yakakolitimlima. Tuwalagiti wapalu woseri na wadala woseri pamuhera na wana woseri. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Kumbiti mifugu pamuhera na vintu vyaviweriti mumiji ilii tuvitoliti.<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />Su mushaka shilii tuitoliti isi ilii ya walii wafalumi wawili wa Waamori yawalikaliti kumwambu kwa lushemba Yoridani, pakati pa lushemba Arinoni na lugongu Herimoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Wasidoni lugongu alu Herimoni walushemiti Siriyoni, Waamori walushema lugongu alu Seniri. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Tuitoliti kwa makakala miji yoseri yaiweriti kulularanda na Gileyadi na Bashani mpaka miji ya Saleki na Edireyi, mji gwa mfalumi Ogu aku Bashani.<verse eid="DEU 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />Mfalumi Ogu gwa aku Bashani ndo shikambaku yakasigaliti gweka yakuwi pakati pa Warefai. Jeneza lyakuyi linyawituwiti kwa shuma, liweriti na utali wa meta msheshi na upana wa meta mbili. Jeneza lyakuyi liwera aku mpaka leru mumji gwa Waamoni aku Laba.<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubaguluwa kwa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />Patuitoliti kwa makakala isi ayi, nuwapananiti makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi enewu lya kwanjira kushana mwa mji gwa Aroeri pakwegera na Arinoni na nusu ya vigongu vya Gileyadi pamuhera na miji yakuwi. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />“Shakapanu nilipananiti nusu ya likabila lya Manasi enewu lyalisigaliti lya Gileyadi pamuhera na Bashani yoseri yaikolituwitimlima na mfalumi Ogu, enewu lyoseri lya Arigogu. Isi yoseri ya Bashani imanikana kuwera isi ya Warefayi.” <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Yairi yakaweriti mkulu gwa likabila lya Manasi, yomberi katoliti enewu lyoseri lya isi ya Arigogu, ndo Bashani, mpaka mumbaka wa Geshuri na Maaka. Vijiji vyoseri kavipananiti litawu lyakuyi, su mpaka leru vimanika handa vijiji vya Yairi.<verse eid="DEU 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Makiri wa likabila lya Manasi, nuwapananiti mji gwa Gileyadi, <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />wantu wa makabila ga Rubeni pamuhera na Gadi nuwapananiti isi yoseri kulawa mji gwa Gileyadi mpaka lushemba Arinoni. Mbaka yawu uwega wa kusika, uweriti pakati pa lularanda lwa lushemba Arinoni na uwega wa kushana mbaka yawu iweriti lushemba Yaboki ndo yaiweriti mbaka na isi ya Waamori. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji, isi yawu iyeneyiti mpaka lushemba Yoridani, kulawa litanda Galilaya uwega wa kushana, useleriti mpaka Bahari ya Araba, kugenda mpaka Bahari ya Munu, mpaka miseleru ya Pisiga uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />Shaka shilii nuwapananiti makabila matatu malagizu aga, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawapananiti isi ayi uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani iweri yawu. Vinu shonta lyenu watoli silaha waloki lushemba Yoridani kuitola kwa makakala isi pawawalongolera walongu wenu Waisraeli. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Kumbiti wadala wenu na wana wenu na wankanyama wenu, nivimana kuwera muwera na mifugu ivuwa, hawasigali mumiji yaniwapananiti. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Muwatangi walongu wenu Waisraeli mpaka Mtuwa Mlungu pakawawezesha womberi kulikala kwa ponga pa womberi kuitola kala kwa makakala isi yoseri Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawapanana womberi uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani ntambu yakatenditi kwa mwenga uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba. Pa aga, mwenga woseri muweza kuwuya muisi ayi yaniwapananiti.<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />Shakapanu numlagaliriti Yoshuwa, gwenga guwona kwa masu gaku vitwatira vyoseri virii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, vyakawatendiriti wafalumi walii Sihoni na Ogu. Su Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatenderi ntambu iraa ayi wafalumi wa isi zoseri zyamwingira. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Namuwatira womberi toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu ndo hakalikomangi ngondu badala yenu.<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kaleweleruwa kwingira muisi ya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />Mushaka shilii, numuhigiti Mtuwa Mlungu panonga, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, nivimana gwanja hera kuwonisiya neni ntumintumi gwaku ukulu waku na makakala gaku makulu gaguweza kutenda. Hashi kwana mlungu gaa aku kumpindi ama pasipanu yakaweza kutenda vitwatira vikulu na vya kulikangasha ntambu yaguvitenda gwenga? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Gundeki neni ndoki lushemba Yoridani, niwoni isi yaiwera na mbotu uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji, isi iherepa ya migongu pamuhera na migongu ya Lebanoni.<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kankalaliriti toziya ya mwenga, kalemiti kumpikanira. Badala yakuwi kang'ambiriti, itosha! Nagutakula kayi shitwatira ashi. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Gukweni kulupeleru lwa lugongu Pisiga, guloli uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji na kushana na kusika na kwagulawa mshenji na guiyoni isi ilii, kumbiti gwenga hapeni guloki lushemba lwa Yoridani. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Kumbiti gumlagaliri Yoshuwa shilii shakafiruwa kutenda na gumgangamaziyi, toziya yomberi ndo ulii hakawalongoziyi Waisraeli kuloka lushemba Yoridani kugenda kuitola kwa makakala isi yagugenda kuiwona.<verse eid="DEU 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />Su tusigaliti kulikala mulularanda pakwegera na mji gwa Beti Peori.<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s">Musa kankuwahiga Waisraeli kumjimira Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Shapakanu Musa kawagambiriti Waisraeli, Mugajimiri malagaliru goseri galii na malagizu goseri ganuwafunditi. Handa pagutenda aga, mwenga hamulikali na hamwingiri kuihala isi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwa wambuyi wetu kankuwapanana. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Namuwongera shintu shoseri ama kupungura shoseri muvilii vyanuwagambiriti. Mugajimiri malagaliru goseri ga Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, galii ganuwapanana. <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Maweni mwenga muviwoniti vitwatira virii Mtuwa Mlungu vyakavitenditi aku Baali Peori. Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawagamiziyiti wantu woseri pakati penu yawamguwiriti ulaa mlungu aku Baali Peori. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Kumbiti mwenga yamuweriti waminika kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mwenga mulikala mpaka leru.<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />Mloli, neni nuwafunditi malagaliru na malagizu gambira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu ntambu yakanagalira ntendi, su mugajimiri muisi yamgenda kuhala. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Mugajimiri nakamu toziya pamtenda hangu, hamuwalanguziyi wantu wa isi zyamonga kuwera mwenga mwana mahala. Pawapikanira visoweru vyenu kuhusu malagaliru aga, womberi hawalongi, nakaka Waisraeli wawera na luhala na mahala.<verse eid="DEU 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />Kwahera isi yoseri ilii ata paiwera nkulu ntambu gaa, isi ilii mlungu gwakuwi kawera pakwegera nayi ntambu yakawera pakwegera na twenga Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu patumluwa utanga. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Kayi kwahera isi yamonga ata paiwera nkulu ntambu gaa, yaiwera na malagizu gagaherepa na teratera gambira aga ganuwafunda lishaka lya leru. <verse eid="DEU 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Muliloli weri, namulyaluwa vitwatira virii vyamuviwoniti maweni. Nailawira ata mala yimu mumakaliru genu vitwatira avi viwuki mumiyoyu mwenu. Muwatambiri visoweru avi wana wenu na wazukulu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Muwatambiri kuhusu lishaka ilii patugolokiti kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kulugongu Sinayi, palii pakang'ambiriti, guwajojoniri wantu pamuhera, su womberi hawapikaniri shilii shanonga. Nfira womberi walifunda kumgohelera mashaka goseri ga makaliru gawu na kuwafunda wana wawu kutenda ntambu iraa ilii.<verse eid="DEU 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />Su mwenga msegeleriti na kugoloka paluseleru lya lugongu lulii shaka shilii luweriti lyankuyaka motu yagugenditi mpaka kulyera, lugongu ligubikituwiti na lihundu lititi na lyosi. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti na wambuyi wetu kulawa pakati pa motu gulii. Wambuyi wetu wavipikaniriti visoweru vyakalongiti kumbiti wamwoniti ndiri ntambu yakawera. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawabweleriti womberi lipatanu lyakuyi, lilii mweni kafira mwenga viraa mulijimiri. Kawapananiti malagaliru lilongu. Kagalembiti malagaliru aga muvibawu viwili vya mabuwi gagasongolutuwiti. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Na Mtuwa Mlungu kanagaliriti kugafunda mashariti na malagizu aga gamfiruwa kugajimira muisi yamgenda kuitola kwa makakala.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maberiziwu kuusu kuviguwira vinyagu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />Kumbiti muliloli weri! Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti na mwenga kulawa mumotu kulugongu Sinayi, mwenga mumwoniti ndiri ntambu yakaweriti. <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />Namtenda vidoda kwa kulinyawira maweni vinyagu! Namulinyawira shinyagu shashilifana na muntu mpalu ama mdala, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />ama shashilifana na nkanyama yoseri pasipanu ama mpongu, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />ama shashilifana na nkanyama yakalikwakwa pasipanu ama somba yakalikala mumashi. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Muliloli weri, pamlola kulyera namjeruwa kuguwira shoseri shamushiwona aku handa mshenji ama lyezi ama ntondu. Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kaviwumbiti toziya ya wantu pasipanu. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kawalaviyiti mwenga kulawa Misri, kulii mwenga mtabikiti gambira muweriti mulitanuri lyaliwera na motu gukaripa. Kawalaviyiti aku su muweri wantu wakuwi wa gweka ntambu yamuwera leru. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />Toziya ya mwenga, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kankaliriti neni na kalirapiriti nakaka hapeni ndoki lushemba Yoridani kugenda kwingira muisi yaiwera na mbotu, isi ilii yakakupanani. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti kuwera hahowi panu na hapeni ndoki lushemba, kumbiti mwenga mwapakwegera kuloka kugenda kuitola makakala isi ilii yaiwera na mbotu. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Muliloli weri, namulyaluwa lipatanu lilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu lyakalitenditi pamuhera na mwenga. Namulinyawira shinyagu kusonguluwa mfanu wa shintu shoseri shilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu shakatulewelera kushifaniziya, <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, ndo motu yagwagamaziya, mweni ndo Mlungu yakawera na weya. <verse eid="DEU 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />Pamuhera muisi ilii ya Kanaani, pamlera wana na pamuhera na wazukulu na mwenga pamuhera wazewi, namtenda vidoda kwa kulitendera shinyagu sha kusonguluwa mfanu wa shintu shoseri, ashi shiwera shitwatira shikondora, su Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawakalaliri mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />Leru neni hanshemi kumpindi ama pasipanu kulola shilii shamtenda. Handa pamlema kulijimira lipatanu lilii lyanuwagambira, mwenga hamuhowi muisi yamgenda kuhala aku kumwambu kwa lushemba Yoridani. Hapeni mulikali aku kwa shaka shitangara, kumbiti mwenga hamwagamiziwi nakamu. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawapalasiyi mwenga pakati pa isi zyamonga, aku wamu wenu wadidi hawasigali. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Mwenga pamuhera aku muisi zyamonga, hamuwaguwiri wamilungu yainyawituwiti kwa mbawu na mabuwi, milungu yainyawituwiti na wantu, milungu ilii yaiweza ndiri kuwona shintu shoseri ama kupikanira shoseri ama kuliya shoseri ama kunusa shoseri. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Kumbiti pamuhera muisi azi na pamumsakula nakaka Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, su mwenga hamumpati handa pamumsakula kwa moyu goseri na rohu yoseri. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Mwenga pamuhera muntabiku na vintu vyoseri avi pavilawira kwa mwenga, shakapanu hamumuwuyiri Mtuwa Mlungu na kumjimira. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, ndo Mlungu yakawera na lusungu, hapeni kawaleki ama kuwagamiziya ama kulilyaluwa lipatanu lyakuyi lilii lyakalitenditi na wambuyi wetu kwa kulirapa.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />Muliholi nentu kuusu makashu, mushaka mwenga hamweniyuwuki, kuusu goseri kwanjira Mlungu pakamuumbiti muntu pasipanu. Msakuli kila pahala kumpindi na pasipanu, handa shitwatira sha kulikangasha sha ntambu ayi shipatiti kulawira na kupikana! <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Hashi, kwana wantu yawapikaniriti kala liziwu lya Mlungu palilonga kulawa mumotu, ntambu mwenga yampikaniriti, womberi wasigariti wakomu? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Hashi, kwana mlungu yoseri yumonga yakajeriti nakaka kugenda kulitolera wantu wakuwi kulawa muisi yamonga, gambira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu ntambu yakatenditi kwa kutumiya majeru na malangaliru na makangashu, kwa ngondu na kwa makakala gakuyi makulu, katenditi vitwatira vya kutiriziya, virii mwenga muviwoniti kwa masu genu kulii Misri? <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawalanguziyani aga, su mwenga memuvimani kuwera mweni ndo Mlungu nakaka gwa gweka, na kwahera Mlungu yumonga. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Mweni kawatenditi mpikaniri liziwu lyakuyi kulawa kumpindi su kawezi kuwafunda. Pasipanu kawalanguziyani motu gwakuwi mkulu na kupikanira visoweru vyakuwi kulawa pakati pa motu gulii. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Toziya kawafiriti wambuyi wetu, mweni kawasyaguliti mwenga washiyuwuku shawu, kawalaviyiti mweni kwa makakala gakuyi makulu kulawa muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />Kaziwingiti kulongolu kwenu isi nkulu na zyaziwera na makakala kuliku mwenga, su kawajegi na kuwapanana isi yawu iweri uhala wenu, ntambu yaiwera mpaka leru! <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Su leru muliholi nakaka Mtuwa Mlungu ndo Mlungu, yomberi kakolamlima kumpindi na pasipanu, na kwahera Mlungu gwingi. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Mugajimiri malagaliru goseri na malagizu galii nankuwapanana leru, su goseri hagaherepi kwa mwenga na kwa shiyuwuku shenu na mwenga hamulikali shaka shitangara muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu yakawapanana iweri yamwenga mashaka goseri.<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miji ya kutugira kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yoridani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Musa katuliti gweka miji mitatu uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />mumiji ayi muntu hakawezi kutugira na kuliponiziya, handa pakamlaga pota kufira muntu yakawera ndiri mngondu gwakuwi. Muntu handa ayu hakawezi kutugira mumji gumu pamiji ayi na kugalopuziya makaliru gakuyi. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Kwa likabila lya Rubeni, Musa katuliti mji gwa Beseri mulilaranda lya shiwala. Kwa likabila lya Gadi, yomberi katuliti mji gwa Ramoti muisi ya Gileyadi. Na kwa likabila lya Manasi, yomberi katuliti mji gwa Golani muisi ya Bashani.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulongoleru wa malagaliru ga Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Aga ndo malagaliru ga Mlungu, Musa gakawapananiti Waisraeli. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Aga ndo maamliru na mashariti na malagizu galii Musa gakawagambiriti Waisraeli pawalawiti muisi ya Misri, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />pawaweriti kumwambu mwa lushemba Yoridani, kulularanda lwaluwera kulongolu kwa Beti Peori, muisi yaiweriti ya mfalumi Sihoni gwa Waamori, yakakolitimlima kulawa kumjini Heshiboni, Musa pamuhera na Waisraeli wamkankiti yomberi pawalawiti Misri. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Waisraeli waitoliti kwa makakala isi yakuwi na isi ya mfalumi Ogu gwa Bashani. Wafalumi awa wawii wa Waamori wakolitimlima aku kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Isi ayi ieneyiti kulawa Aroeri, mumpeku mwa lushemba Arinoni, mpaka lugongu Sirioni, viraa ishemuwa lugongu lwa Herimoni. <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />Pamuhera na enewu lyoseri uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani mpaka Bahari ya Munu na paluseleru mulugongu Pisiga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s">Malagaliru lilongu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Kulawa 20:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />“Musa kawashemiti pamuhera Waisraeli, su kawagambiriti, mwenga Waisraeli, mpikaniri malagaliru na malagizu galii gantakula leru kulongolu kwenu. Mulifundi aga na mugajimili.” <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu katuliti lipatanu pamuhera na twenga kuligongu Sinayi. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Katuliti ndiri hera lipatanu ali na wambuyi wetu, kumbiti kalituliti ali viraa kwa twenga yatulikala leru. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Mwenga mumpikaniriti Mtuwa Mlungu, pakayoweriti na mwenga kulii kulugongu pakati pa motu. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Shaka shilii neni weriti mjumbi pakati penu na Mtuwa Mlungu, kuwagambira shilii shakatakuliti Mlungu, toziya mwenga mgutiriti motu gulii na mkweniti ndiri kugenda kulugongu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti hangu, <verse eid="DEU 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku yanukulaviyiti kulawa muisi ya Misri, kulii guweriti mmanda.<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />Nagumguwira Mlungu yumonga, kumbiti gunguwiri neni hera.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />Nagulisongoluwa gamweni shinyagu shoseri shashilanguziya kuwera mlungu, ama mfanu gwa shintu shoseri shashiwera kumpindi ama shashiwera pasipanu, ama shashiwera mumashi pasi pa pasipanu. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Nagushisuntamalira shinyagu shoseri ama kuvitedera, toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku, nfira gunguwiri neni gweka yangu. Nankuwazibu wana kwa vidoda vya watati wawu wa shileri sha tatu na shileri sha msheshi sha walii yawanemiti. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Kumbiti nankulanguziya ufiru gwangu kwa maelufu ga vileri kwa walii yawanfira neni na kugajimira malagalliru gangu.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />Nagulitendera litawu lyangu kwa lengu lya ukondola, toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku hanuwazibu woseri walii yawalitendera litawu lyangu kwa ntambu ya ukondola.<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />Nagulyaluwa kuwera lishaka lya Kwoyera. Gulityeki lishaka ali kuwera linanagala ntambu yanuwalagaliriti mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Mumashaka sita gutendi mahengu na kuvitenda vitwatira vyaku vyoseri, <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />kumbiti lishaka lya saba mukila lijuwa haliweri lishaka lya Kwoyera, lishaka ali lituluwa kwajili ya neni Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. Mulishaka ali nagutenda lihengu lyoseri gwenga ama mwana mpalu gwaku ama muhinga gwaku ama ntumintumi gwaku mpalu ama mdala nawatenda mahengu. Nagumtenda kwa makakala mfugu gwaku katendi mahengu, viraa nagumgambira muhenga yakalikala muisi yaku katendi mahengu. Guwalekeziyi wamanda waku kwoyera mulishaka ali ntambu yamtenda mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Nagulyaluwa kuwera gwenga guweriti mmanda paguweriti muisi Misri, neni Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku nukulaviyiti kulawa kulii kwa makakala gangu makulu nentu. Kwa toziya ayi neni Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku nukulagalira kwoyera mulishaka lya saba mukila lijuwa.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />Gumgohelili tati gwaku pamuhera na mawu gwaku, gambira neni Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku ntambu yanukulagaliriti, gugajimili aga su hagulikali mashaka gatangala na kuwera na mota muisi ilii yang'enda kukupanana.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />“Nagulaga,”<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />“Naguhumba,”<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />“Nagwiwa,”<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />“Nagulaviya ukapitawu wa upayira kuusu muntu yoseri.”<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />“Naguwera na mata kwa mdala gwa wapakwegera gwaku, viraa naguwera na mata kwa shoseri shilii shashiwera mnumba ya wapakwegera gwaku, ama mulirambu lyakuyi ama mmanda gwakuwi mpalu ama mdala, ama ng'ombi gwakuwi ama punda gwakuwi ama shintu shoseri shilii shakawera nashi wapakwegera gwaku.<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />Aga ndo malagaliru galii Mtuwa Mlungu gakawalagaliriti wambuyi wetu. Womberi pawajojonikiti paluseleru lwa lugongu, Mlungu kayoweriti kwa liziwu likulu kulawa pakati pa motu, mulihundi lititi na ntiti totoru lyaligubikiti lugongu. Kawagambiriti malagaliru aga hera pota kwongera gingi, shakapanu kagalembiti muvibawu viwili vya mabuwi gasongoluwiti, su kanupiti.<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lyoga lya wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />Wazewi wetu pawapikaniriti liziwu lya Mtuwa Mlungu kulawa pakati pa ntiti ilii palugongu lwaluweriti lyankuyaka motu, wakulu woseri wa makabila getu pamuhera na wazewi waniziriti neni. <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />Womberi walongiti, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, katugubutulila ulangala na ukulu wakuwi, tupikanira liziwu lyakuyi kulawa pakati pa motu gulii. Leru tuyambula kuwera iwezekana kwa twenga wantu kwendeleya kulikala ata Mlungu pakayowera na twenga. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Kumbiti twenga tutira na hatuhowi handa patupikanira Mtuwa Mlungu pakayowera kayi na twenga, motu gwakuwi yagutiliziya hagutulagi. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Hashi, kwana muntu yoseri yakaweziti kumpikanira Mlungu yakawera na makakala goseri pakayowera kulawa pakati pa motu ntambu yatumpikaniriti twenga shakapanu kendereyi kulikala? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Su gwenga Musa gukweni kugenda kuligongu na gupikanili kila shintu Mtuwa Mlungu shakagenda kutakula. Shakapanu gwizi kutugambira kila shintu shakalongiti, su twenga hatupikaniri shilii shakataluliti na hatujimili na kushitenda.”<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kawapikaniriti pamung'ambiriti na kang'ambiriti, mpikanira virii wantu vyawakugambiriti ndo vya nakaka. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Womberi mewaliholi kuwera na maholu aga ga kungohela na kugajimila malagaliru gangu mashaka goseri, vitwatira vyawu vyoseri meviherepi kwawu na kwa wana wawu mashaka goseri. <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Guseleri pasi gwakawagambiri womberi wawuyi mumalingu gawu. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Shakapanu gwenga Musa guwuyi panu na kuwera pakwegera na neni, neni hanikupanani gwenga malagaliru goseri na mashariti na malagizu galii, gwenga haguwafundi womberi hawagajimili muisi yang'enda kuwapanana wahali.”<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />Su mwenga mulikali weri mukila shintu Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakawalagaliriti, mushijimiri kila shintu shamgambirituwiti. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Mugajimiri goseri Mtuwa Mlungu gakatakuliti, su kila shintu hashiherepi kwaku na hagwendereyi kulikala muisi yamgenda kuhala.<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s">Lilagaliru likulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />Aga ndo malagaliru na mashariti na malagizu galii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kanagaliriti nuwafundi, su mugajimiri muisi yamgenda kwingira na kuhala. <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />Gwenga pamuhera na shiyuwuku shaku mfiruwa kumgohelera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu shaka shoseri shamulikala. Handa pamujimira mashariti na malagaliru gakuyi, mwenga hamunemeleli mumakaliru gavuwa. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Su mwenga Waisraeli, mpikaniri weri na mgajimili aga, su kila shintu hashiweri weri kwa mwenga pamulikala na hamwongereki nentu muisi yaiwera na mbotu kwa walimi na kuliziya mifugu gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakawalagiliti wambuyi wetu.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />Su mpikaniri mwenga Waisraeli! Mtuwa Mlungu hera ndo Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Mumfiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kwa myoyu yenu yoseri na kwa rohu yenu yoseri na makakala genu goseri. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Namugalyaluwa malagaliru aga yanuwapanana leru. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Muwafundi aga wana wenu kayi na kayi. Hamuwatambiri aga ukaya kwenu ama pamgenda mwanja ama pamgenda kugonja ama pamwimuka. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Mugalembi malagaliru aga muvintola na mutawi mumawoku mwenu na muviwunju vya sheni zyenu kuwera liholuziwu. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Mugalembi viraa muvizingiti vya magomi ga numba zyenu pamuhera na mumagomi makulu genu.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kankuwabereziya wantu yawamjimira ndiri Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawalagiliti wambuyi wenu Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakubu kuwera hakawapanani mwenga isi ilii yaiwera kala na miji mikulu na iherepa, miji ilii mwenga muinyawiti ndiri. <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />Viraa kalagiliti kuwera numba zyaziwera mumiji ilii hazimemi vintu viherepa, kwahera muntu yakavituliti, hamteki mashi mumanegu galii mwenga mugabawiti ndiri na hamuliyi mabwajubwaju mumalambu ga mizyabibu na mizyetuni ilii mwenga muiyaliti ndiri. Su Mtuwa Mlungu pakawajega kwingira muisi ilii mwenga pamuhera na shiboga shamfira, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />mulikali weri namumlyaluwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawalaviyiti Misri kulii kwamuweriti wamanda. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Mumgohelili Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mumtenderi gweka yakuwi na gutuli lapiru lyaku kupitira litawu lyakuyi. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Namuwaguwira wamilungu wamonga, wamilungu ya wantu yawawera pakwegera na mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />Handa pamuwaguwira wamilungu wamonga, maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu hagawiziri mwenga gambira motu na hagawagamiziyi nakamu pasipanu.<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />Namumjera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu ntambu yamtenditi kulii Masa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Nakaka mumashaka goseri mugajimili malagaliru goseri na amuli na malagizu na mashariti galii gampananituwiti. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Mtendi galii gagamfiriziya Mtuwa Mlungu, su goseri gamtenda hagaweri gaherepa kwa mwenga. Shakapanu hamwingiri kuhala isi ilii iherepa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawalagiliti wambuyi wetu. <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />Mwenga humuwawingi wangondu wenu woseri gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagiliti.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />Mumashaka gagizaku, wana wenu pawawakosiya, iwera hashi Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu katulagalila twenga tujimili malagaliru na malagizu na mashariti goseri aga? <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Mwenga hamuwawankuli hangu, twenga tuweriti wamanda wa Farao, mfalumi gwa Misri, Mtuwa Mlungu katulaviyiti Misri kwa makakala gakuyi makulu. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Twenga twaweni tumwoniti pakatenda mawuzawuza ga ntambu yingiyingi na katenditi vitwatira vya kutiliziya kwa wantu wa Misri na mfalumi gwa Misri pamuhera na wakulu wakuwi. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Katulaviyiti kulawa Misri, katujega panu na kutupanana isi ayi ntambu yakalagiliti kuwera mekawapanani wambuyi wetu. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu katulagaliriti kugajimira malagaliru goseri na kumguwira kwa mota yatwenga, su kapati kutulolera mashaka goseri ntambu yaiwera leru. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Shintu shashifaa kwa twenga ndo kujimila kila shintu Mtuwa Mlungu shakatulagaliriti.<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankuwasyagula wantu wakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Kulawa 34:11-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawajegi kwingira muisi ilii yamgenda kuitola kwa makakala, mweni hakaviwingi vipinga vivuwa vya wantu walawi muisi ilii. Pamwingira Mtuwa Mlungu hakawawingi kulawa kulongolu kwenu, Wahiti na Wagirigashi na Waamoni na Wakanaani na Waperizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi, azi isi saba nkulu na zyaziwera na makakala nentu kuliku mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakawatenda mwenga muwakanki womberi, mwenga mfiruwa muwalagi wantu woseri. Namtenda mapatanu na womberi ama kuwawonera lusungu. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Namuyugana na womberi, namuwalekeziwa wahinga wenu kuyuguwa na wantu awa ama wana wantemba wenu kuyuga wahinga wa wantu awa. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Toziya pamtenda hangu, wantu walii hawawatendi wana wenu kuleka kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu na kuwaguwira wamilungu wamonga. Maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu hagawiziri mwenga na kuwagamiziya kamkamu. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Ntambu ayi ndo yamgenda kutenda kwa wantu walii. Mpatangi vitalawanda vyawu vya kutambikira na mbomolangi mpanda zawu za mabuwi zyazityekutuwituwiti kwa mlungu gwawu Baali, viraa mbomolangi vinyagu vya mpanda zawu za Ashera na muvilunguziyi nakamu vinyagu vyawu mumotu. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Toziya mwenga mwawananagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawasyaguliti mwenga kulawa pakati pa wantu woseri yawawera pasipanu kuwera wantu wakuwi wa gweka.<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawafiriti ndiri mwenga na kuwasyagula toziya mwenga mwawantu wavuwa kuliku wantu wamonga, kumbiti mwenga muweriti watangara ndiri kuliku wantu wa isi zyamonga pasipanu. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawafiriti mwenga na kafiliti kutenda shilii shakawalagiliti wambuyi wetu kuwera hakawalopoli kwa makakala gakuyi makulu na kuwatenda muweri walekelu kulawa muumanda wa Farao mfalumi gwa Misri. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Su muvimani kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu ndo Mlungu mwaminika, kalitenda lipatanu lyakuyi lya ufiru kwa maelufu ga wantu wa vileri virii yawamfira mweni na kutenda shilii shakatulagaliriti. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu hapeni kaleki kuwazibu na kuwagamiziya walii yawamlema. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Su mwenga mfiruwa kugajimila malagaliru na mashariti na malagizu goseri galii ganuwapanana mwenga leru.<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matekeleru ga kujimila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />Handa pampikanira malagizu aga na kugajimila kwa uwaminika, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakalitendi lipatanu lyakuyi kwenu ntambu yakawalagiliti kwa shirapu kwa wambuyi wetu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Hakawafiri mwenga na kuwatekelera na hakawapanani mwenga wana wavuwa. Viraa hakagatekeleri malambu genu gaweri na mabenu na divayi na lipaki lya mizyetuni, viraa hakawatekeleri kwa kuwapanana wang'ombi na wakondolu wavuwa muisi yakawalagiliti wambuyi wetu kuwera hakawapanani mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Hamtekeleluwi kuliku wantu wamonga woseri pasipanu. Pakati penu hapeni kuweri na wapalu ama wadala yawahera wana ama mifugu yenu yaiwera mpendi. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawaloleri weri kulawa mumalweli goseri. Mwenga hapeni muweri na malweli goseri ga kutiriziya ntambu yagawapatiti wambuyi wetu aku Misri, kumbiti malweli aga hagawapati wangondu wetu. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Muvyagamiziyi vipinga vyoseri vya wantu virii Mtuwa Mlungu pakawatenda mwenga muwakanki, namuwawonera lusungu. Namuwaguwira milungu yawu, tembera shitwatira ashi hashiweri ligomeziwu kwa mwenga.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />Namuligambira maweni, wantu awa wavuwa kuliku twenga, hatuwezi hashi kuwawinga muisi ayi? <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Namuwatira, muliholi Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu ntambu yakamtenditi mfalumi pamuhera na wantu woseri wa Misri. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Muholi malweli ga kutiriziya galii wambuyi wetu wawoniti Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakawakomiti wantu wa Misri, na ntambu ya mawuzawuza na makangashu na uwezu mkulu yakautenditi Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu na kwa makakala makulu yakawalaviyiti wambuyi wenu kulawa Misri. Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakatendi ntambu iraa ayi kwa wantu woseri vinu yamuwatira. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakatendi womberi washashatiki, na hawagamiri walii yawasigala wakomu na kutuga kulififa kulawa kwa mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Su namuwatira toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kapamuhera na mwenga. Mweni ndo Mlungu mkulu na yakatiriziya. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawawingi wantu wa isi ntambu mwenga yamwongereka shididinishididini. Hapeni muwezi kuwagamiziya wantu woseri kwa mala yimu, toziya pamtenda hangu walanga ya wankanyama wa kuntundu haiyongereki kwa mwenga na kuwagaziya. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakatendi muwakanki wangondu wenu na kuwatenda washashatiki mpaka pawagamira. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Viraa hakatendi mwenga muwakanki wafalumi wawu. Mwenga hamuwalagi na wantu hawawalyaluwi. Kwahera muntu yoseri hakawezi kuwalewelera mwenga, mwenga hamuwagamiziyi woseri. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Muvilunguziyi vinyagu vyawu vya kusongola vya milungu yawu. Namuwera na matamata kutola madini ga feza ama zahabu, pamtola vintu avi kuwera vyamwenga, vintu avi haviweri magomeziwu kwa mwenga, toziya vintu avi viwera vikalaliru kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Namujega ukaya kwenu shinyagu shoseri, toziya pamvijega vintu avi ukaya kwenu, Mlungu hakawapangili mwenga ntambu yakawapangiliti womberi. Mwenga mfiruwa muvilemi na kuvikalalira nentu toziya vintu avi Mtuwa Mlungu kavipangiliti.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s">Isi iherepa ya kuhala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />Mwenga mfiruwa kuwera waminika kugajimila malagaliru goseri ganuwapanana leru. Shakapanu mwenga hamulikali na kwongereka na hamwingiri na kuitola kwa makakala isi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu yakawalagiliti kuwapanana wambuyi wetu. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Namulyaluwa ntambu Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawalongoziyiti mwenga kushiwala kwa mivinja malongu msheshi, kawatenditi mwenga muweri na ntabiku toziya kafiliti mwenga namulitumba maweni kumbiti mumtumbiri yomberi na mfundiki. Viraa kafiliti kuwajera mwenga su kavimani shamulihola kutenda, handa mwenga memjimiri malagaliru gakuyi ama ndala. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Kawalekiti mwenga mtabiki, katenditi muweri na njala, shakapanu kawapananiti shiboga kulawa kumpindi shashishemuwa mana mwenga mliyi. Shiboga ashi mwenga mushimaniti ndiri ama wambuyi wetu hawenishimani. Mlungu katenditi hangu su kawafundi kuwera muntu hapeni kalikali kwa libumunda hera, kumbiti hakalikali kwa kila shakatakula Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Mushaka ashi sha mivinja malongu msheshi, nguwu zyetu zisakaliti ndiri, viraa magulu genu gakwepuka ndiri. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Muliholi kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kankuwazibu gambira tati ntambu yakawakanya wana wakuwi. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Su mwenga mugajimiri malagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mulikali makaliru ga kumgohelera na kumjimira mweni. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawajega mwenga muisi iherepa yaiwera na mbotu, isi ilii yaiwera na lushemba zivuwa na mbwiru na mashi yagabwituka kulawa kulularanda na kumigongu, <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />isi yaiwera na nganu na shayiri na mizyabibu na tini na mikomamanga na mizyetuni na luwashi. <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />Aku mwenga hampati shiboga shivuwa na hapeni mpungukiwi shintu. Matalawu gakuyi gawera na madini ga shuma na migongu yakuwi muweza kubawa madini ga shaba. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Hamliyi na kwikuta, hamlongi mayagashi Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, kwa isi iherepa yakawapananiti.<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liberiziwu kuusu kumlyaluwa Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />Musa kendereyiti kuwagambira Waisraeli, muliloli weri namumlyaluwa kwa kuleka kugajimira malagaliru gakuyi na malagizu gakuyi na mashariti gakuyi ganuwapanana leru. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Mwenga pamuliya na kwikuta, pamnyawa numba ziherepa na kulikala amu, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />viraa wang'ombi wenu na wakondolu wenu na zahabu na mdini ga feza na kila shintu pashyongereka, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />mwenga namuwera na ubinta na kumlyaluwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, Mlungu yakawalaviyiti kulawa muisi ya Misri, kulii mwenga muweriti wamanda. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yakawalongoziyiti mwenga kushiwala shilii shikulu na kutiriziya, shiwala shashiweriti na wanjoka yawawera na usungu na vipinini, isi ilii yaiweriti ndiri na mashi, mweni kawalaviriti mashi kulawa mulitalawu liganga shuma. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Kayi mweni ndo yakawaliyiziyiti shiboga sha mana kushiwala, shiboga shilii wambuyi wetu washimaniti ndiri. Kagatenditi aga goseri mwenga mpati tabu na kuwajera su kawapanani maherepa. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Su mwenga muliloli weri namwiza kulitakulila mumyoyu mwenu, kulawirana na makakala na uwezu wetu twenga twaweni tuwera walunda. <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Muliholi kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, ndo ulii yakawapanana uwezu wa kuwera walunda. Kankutenda hangu toziya kawera mwaminika kwa lipatanu lilii lyakalilapiriti kwa wambuyi wetu kuwera mekalitendi. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Mwenga namumlyaluwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu na kuifata wamilungu wamonga su kuyitendera na kuyiguwira. Nankuwaberiziya mwenga leru pamuiguwira nakaka hamwagamiri. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Pamumjimira ndiri Mtuwa Mlungu, mwenga hamwagamiziwi gambira isi zilii Mlungu zakazyagamiziya mwenga pamulikomangiti ngondu nawu.<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s">Wantu yawajimila ndiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />Mpikaniri mwenga Waisraeli! Leru mwapakwegera kuloka lushemba Yoridani kugenda kutola kwa makakala isi nkulu na wantu wakuwi wawera na makakala nentu kuliku mwenga, miji mikulu yawalikala iwera na vibambaza vitalipa mpaka kulyera. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Wantu yawawera mumiji ayi watalipa na wawera na makakala, wantu awa walawa mushiyuwuku sha Anaki. Mwenga ntambu yamuvimana na ntambu yampikaniriti wantu pawakosiya, hashi, gaa yakaweza kuwakomanga wantu wa Anaki? <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Kumbiti muvimani leru kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawalongoleri. Hakaweri gambira motu mkulu. Hakawagamiziyi woseri na kuwakanka kulongolu kwenu, su mwenga hamuwawingi na kuwagamiziya mala yimu gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagiliti.<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />Pa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kuwawinga wantu walii kulongolu kwa mwenga, mwenga namlonga mumyoyu mwenu, Mtuwa Mlungu katupanana isi ayi toziya twenga twawantu waherepa! Unakaka ndo awu toziya wantu wa isi ilii wawera wakondola Mtuwa Mlungu kawawinga ntambu yamuweriti mwankuwongereka. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Muweza kuitola kwa makakala isi yawu kwa toziya ndiri mwenga mwawantu waheri ama yawawera na myoyu iherepa, kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kankuwawinga wantu walii kulongolu kwa mwenga toziya womberi wawera wakondola na mweni kafira kutenda shilii shakawalagiliti wambuyi wetu, Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakubu. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Su muvimani kuwera kwa toziya ndiri mwenga mwawaheri, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kankuwapanani isi ayi iherepa muihali, toziya mwenga mwawantu yamuwera na ubinta.<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />Namulyaluwa shilii wambuyi wetu shawatenditi kushiwala, shilii shashitenditi Mtuwa Mlungu kawakalalili. Kwanjira lishaka lilii mwenga pamlawiti Misri mpaka lishaka lyamsokiti panu, mwenga viraa mwendereya kumlema Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Ata aku kulugongu Sinayi, wambuyi wetu watenditi Mtuwa Mlungu kawakalalili na kafiliti kuwagamiziya. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Pankweniti kugenda kulugongu kuwanka vibawu vya mabuwi gagasongolituwiti na kulembuwa malagaliru lilongu galii gampananituwiti, neni nilikaliti aku mashaka malongu msheshi, ndiyiti ndiri ama kulanda shintu shoseri shilii. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampananiti neni vibawu virii viwili vya mabuwi vyavilembituwiti kwa shyala sha Mlungu, vibawu virii vilembituwiti visoweru vyoseri virii Mtuwa Mlungu vyakawagambiriti kulawa mumotu kulugongu, mwenga pamjojonikiti pasi paluseleru lwa lugongu. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Lupeleru mwa mashaka galii malongu msheshi, Mtuwa Mlungu kampananiti neni vibawu vya mabuwi galii mawili gakagalembiti visoweru vya lipatanu. <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti, guseleli pasi kalongola, toziya wantu waku yaguwalaviyiti Misri wankutenda ukondola mkulu. Womberi wankutenda shilii neni nalagaliriti nawashitenda, su walinyawila weni shinyagu sha kuyeyusha.<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti, neni mona wantu awa wawera na ubinta nentu. <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Gundeki nuwagamiziyi woseri, kwahera muntu yoseri hakawaholi womberi kuwera waweriti pasipanu. Neni hanikutendi gwenga kuwera tati gwa isi yaimanika na kuwera na makakala nentu kuliku womberi.<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />Su lugongu paluweriti lwakuyaka motu,neni ngalambukiti na kuselera kulawa kulugongu pampapa vibawu virii viwili vya mabuwi vyavilembituwiti malagaliru. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Neni ndoliti na kusintuka kuwera mwenga mtenditi vidoda vikulu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. Mwenga kalongola wanjiti kutenda shintu shilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kalagaliriti nawatenda. Mulinyawiriti kala shinyagu sha kuyeyusha sha su mushiguwiri. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Su vibawu virii vya mabuwi vyaweriti navi na nuvyasiliti pasi, nuvipantiti kulongolu kwenu. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Shakapanu ng'onjiti makukama kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yantenditi kwanja kwa mashaka malongu msheshi pashiru na paluwala pota kuliya ama kulanda shintu. Ntenditi hangu toziya ya wambuyi wenu watenditi vidoda kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kutenda kakalali nentu. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Neni ntiriti nentu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawakalariti nentu mwenga na mekawagamiziyiti nakamu. Kumbiti kayi numluwiti kuwera nakawagamiziya, su kapikaniriti maluwa gangu. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu viraa kamkaliliti Aruni kwa kunyawa shinyagu sha kuyeyusha na kaweriti kala kumlaga Aruni. Kumbiti shaka shilaa shilii nduwiti kwajili ya Aruni nakamlaga viraa na Mtuwa Mlungu kawankuliti maluwa gangu. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Neni nushitoliti shinyagu shilii na kushiyeyusha mumotu, nushiponditi ponditi kuwera ubumu na kuguwasila mulushemba lwalunyinyirika kulawa kulugongu lulii.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />Mwenga viraa mumtenditi Mtuwa Mlungu kakalali kulii Tabera na Masa na Kibiroti Hataava. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Na Mtuwa Mlungu pakawalaviyiti Kadeshi Barineya kalongiti, mgendi mwakaitoli kwa makakala isi yanuwapanana. Kumbiti mwenga mumlemiti na mumjimiriti ndiri ama kushijimira shilii shakalagaliriti. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Mwenga muwera wabinta kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwanjira panuwamaniti.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />Su ng'onjiti makukama kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu mashaka malongu msheshi, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti kuwera mekawagamiziyi nakamu. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Numluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu panongiti, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, wantu awa waku mweni, su naguwagamiziya. Wantu awa ndo walii yaguwalopoliti na kuwalaviya kulawa muisi ya Misri kwa makakala gaku makulu. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Nagulyaluwa shilii shaguwalagiliti wantumintumi waku Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakubu. Nagulola ubinta wawu na ukondola wawu na vidoda vya wantu awa. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Paguwagamiziya wantu awa, wantu wa Misri hawalongi, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kasinda kuwajega kwingira muisi yakawalagiliti, toziya kawakalalila, su kawajegiti kuwalaga kushiwala. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Kumbiti wantu awa waku mweni, guwasyaguliti kuwera waku mweni na guwalaviyiti kulawa Misri kwa makakala gaku na uwezu waku mkulu.<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Musa kankuwanka kayi malagaliru lilongu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Kulawa 34:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />Shaka shilii Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiri, gusongoli vibawu viwili vya mabuwi ntambu yagutenditi kwanja, viraa gunyawi lisanduku lya mbawu kwajili ya kugatula mabuwi aga, shakapanu gukweni kwiza kwaneni kulugongu. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Neni hanembi mumabuwi galii gambira kwanja ntambu yanembiti muvibawu virii vyaguvipantiti, shakapanu guvituli vibawu avi mulisanduku.<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />Su neni nyawiti lisanduku lya mbawu za mjoholu na kusongola vibawu viwili vya mabuwi ntambu yaiweriti kwanja na nkweniti kulugongu pampapa vibawu virii. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalembiti visoweru viraa virii vyakalembiti kwanja muvibawu virii, malagaliru lilongu galii gakawapananiti pakayoweriti na mwenga kulawa mumotu kulugongu, shaka pamjojonikiti paluseleru lwa lugongu. Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kampananiti neni vibawu virii <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />na neni ng'alambukiti kuselera pasi kulawa kulugongu. Ntambu yanagalirituwiti na Mtuwa Mlungu, neni ntuliti vibawu virii mulisanduku lyanyawiti na vinu viwera mla mulisanduku.<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />Waisraeli wagenditi mwanja kulawa mumanegu ga wantu wa Yaakani kugenda Mosera. Kulii Aruni kahowiti na kasiruwiti na Eliazeri mwana gwakuwi kaweriti mtambika pa mweni kuhowa. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Kulawa palii Mosera, wagenditi mwanja mpaka Gudigoda na kulawa Gudigoda wagenditi mwanja mpaka Yotibatiha pahala papawera na lushemba zivuwa za mashi. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Mushaka shilii Mtuwa Mlungu kawasyaguliti wantu wa likabila lya Lawi kupapa lisanduku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, wamtenderi gambira watambika na kuwatekelera wantu kwa litawu lyakuyi. Womberi wankutenda vitwatira avi mpaka shaka ashi. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Su kabila lya wantu wa Lawi lyahera uhala pahala pa Waisraeli ntambu yawawera makabila gamonga. Womberi wawankiti ligoya lya kuwera watambika wa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagiliti.<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />Musa kendereyiti kulonga, nilikaliti kulugongu kwa shaka sha malongu msheshi ntambu yaiweriti kwanja. Mtuwa Mlungu kampikaniriti kayi neni gambira kwanja ntambu yakampikaniriti, na kanjimiriti kuwera hapeni kawagamiziyi. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Shakapanu kang'ambiriti, guwuki gwendereyi na mwanja gwaku, guwalongoziyi wantu kwingira kuitola kwa makakala isi yanuwalagiliti wambuyi wenu kuwera haniwapanani.<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shakafira Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />Vinu mwenga Waisraeli, mpikaniri shilii shakafira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kulawa kwa mwenga. Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kafira mumguwiri na kugajimira goseri gakalagalira. Mumfiri na mumtenderi kwa myoyu na rohu yoseri, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />kugajimira malagaliru na malagizu ga Mtuwa Mlungu ganuwapanana leru kwa mota yenu. <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Guloli, kumpindi na kumpindi ndo vyakuwi Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, pasipanu na vyoseri vyaviweramu viwera vyakuwi. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Kayi Mtuwa Mlungu kawafiriti nentu wambuyi wetu, kawasyaguliti mwenga walera wawu kuwera wantu wakuwi badala ya wantu wamonga woseri ntambu yaiwera leru. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Su kwanjira vinu mumjimiri Mtuwa Mlungu na mleki kuwera na ubinta. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu ndo mkulu nentu kuliku wamilungu woseri, viraa mkulu kuliku wakolamlima woseri. Kawera na makakala nentu na katiliziya, hapeni kapendereyi ama kuwanka swinda. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Mtuwa Mlungu kahakikisha kuwera mshiwa na wakenja hapeni wazulumiwi, viraa kankuwafira ata wahenga kulawa isi zyamonga walii yawalikala pakati penu kankuwapanana shiboga pamuhera na nguwu. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Su muwafiri wahenga viraa toziya mwenga muweriti wahenga muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Mumgoheliri Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu na mumguwiri gweka yakuwi. Muweri waminika kwakuwi na mlagili kwa litawu lyakuyi hera. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Mweni ndo yumu ulii yakafiruwa kukwisuwa. Mweni ndo Mlungu gwenu yakawatendiriti vitwatira avi vikulu na vya kutiriziya vyamuviwoniti kwa masu genu. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Wambuyi wetu pawagenditi Misri waweriti wantu malongu saba hera, kumbiti vinu Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawatenda wavuwa gambira ntondu ya kulyera.<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />Toziya ya goseri galii Mtuwa Mlungu gakagatenditi kwa mwenga, su mumfiri na mwendereyi kugajimira mashariti gakuyi na malagizu gakuyi na malagaliru gakuyi goseri. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Muliholi leru kuusu wana wenu wavimaniti ndiri ama kuwona azabu za Mtuwa Mlungu na uwezu wakuwi na makakala gakuyi, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />malangaliru gakuyi na makangashu gakuyi gakagatenditi kulii Misri kwa mfalumi Farao na isi yakuwi yoseri. <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />Viraa shilii shakashitenditi kwa shonta sha Misri, pamuhera na farasi wawu na mbutuka zyazikwegwa na farasi, ntambu yakalimirizuwiti shonta ali mubahari ya Shamu pawaweriti wankuwafata, ntambu Mtuwa Mlungu lyakalyagamiziyiti nakamu mpaka leru. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Muliholi Mtuwa Mlungu pakawaloriti weri kushiwala pamberi pa kusoka panu. <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />Viraa muliholi vitwatira vyakawatendiriti Datani na Abiramu wana wa Eliyabu gwa likabila lya Rubeni. Kulongolu kwa kila muntu, pasipanu papavugukiti pahala pawaweriti womberi na kuwamira pamuhera na kaya zawu na malingu gawu na wankanyama wawu na kila shintu shashiwera shawu. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Kumbiti mwenga nakaka masu genu gawoniti vitwatira vyoseri avi vikulu Mtuwa Mlungu vyakavitenditi.<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matekeleru ga kujimira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />Mwenga mulilori weri kugajimila malagaliru ganuwapanana leru, su mwenga hamuweri na makakala ga kugenda kuitola kwa makakala isi ilii mwenga yamloka Yoridani kugenda kulikala, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />su mwenga mpati kulikala kwa shaka shivuwa muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu kalirapiriti kwa wambuyi wetu kuwapanana pamuhera na shiyuwuku shawu, isi ilii yaiwera na mbotu kwa kulima na iherepa kwa kuliziya mifugu. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Isi yamgenda kuhala ilifana ndiri na isi ya Misri kwamlawiti, kulii mtenditi mahengu gakamala ga kuyala viboga na kuyitilira mashi kwa magulu. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Kumbiti isi yamgenda kuhala ndo isi ya vigongu na lularanda, isi yaipata mvula ivuwa. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kailolera weri isi ilii, kailolera mushaka shoseri mukila shinja.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />Su mwenga handa pamgajimira malagaliru ganuwapanana leru, pamumfira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu na kumtendera kwa myoyu yenu yoseri na kwa rohu zyenu zoseri, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />pamtenda hangu, Mtuwa Mlungu hakaitoweri mvula isi yenu mushaka shakuwi, mvula za masika na vuli, mwenga hambenangi viboga vyenu na divayi lya syayi pamuhera na lipaki lya mizyetuni. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Neni hameriziwu manyasi mumalambu kwajili ya kuliziya mifugu yenu na maweni mwenga hamuweri na kila shintu shamfira kuliya. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Mulilori weri, myoyu ya mwenga naipotuziwa na kugalambuka na kuwaguwira wamilungu wamonga. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Mwenga pamtenda hangu, Mtuwa Mlungu hakawakalalili nentu na hakaleki kuwatowera mvula na isi haileki kumeriziya vimeru vyakuwi, shakapanu hamwagamiri kalongola kulawa muisi iherepa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawapanana.<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />Muvituli visoweru vyaneni avi mumyoyu mwenu na murohu zyenu. Muvilembi mulukuli na kuvitawa mumawoku mwenu kuwera shimaniziru na kuvala muviwunju vya sheni zyenu. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Muwafundi wana wenu visoweru avi pamulikala mnumba zyenu na pamtyanga na pamgenda kugonja na pamwimuka. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Mugalembi muvizingiti vya magomi ga numba zyenu na mumagomi makulu ga miji yenu, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />su mashaka goseri kulyera pakusigala pampindi pa pasipanu, mwenga pamuhera na wana wenu hamulikali makalilu gatangara muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawalagiliti kuwapanana wambuyi wetu.<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />Muliloli weri kugajimira malagaliru goseri aga ganiwapananiti, mumfiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu na kuzigendera njira zyakuwi zoseri na kuwera waminika kwakuwi, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />su Mtuwa Mlungu hakawawingi wantu wa isi zoseri kulongolu kwa mwenga, mwenga hamuihali isi zilii zyaziwera nkulu na zyaziwera na makakala kuliku mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Kila pahala muisi ilii pampatimbanga hapaweri pa mwenga. Isi yenu haiyeneyi kulawa kushiwala uwega wa kusika mpaka lugongu lwa Lebanoni uwega wa kushana, kulawa lushemba Eufrati uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mpaka ku Bahari ya Meditereniya uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawatendi wantu woseri muisi ilii kuwatira mwenga ntambu yakalagiliti, malawiranu gakuyi kwahera shipinga sha wantu shashiweza kuwapingira mwenga.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />Mloli, leru nankuwapanana usyagula kulongolu kwenu, matekeleru ama mpangilu. <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />Handa pamugajimira malagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu ganuwapanana leru, su hakawatekeleri. <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />Handa pamugajimira ndiri na kugalambuka kuwaguwira wamilungu wamonga, wamilungu walii yamuwamaniti ndiri kwanja, su hakawapangili. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Na Mtuwa Mlungu pakawajega kwingira muisi yamugenda kuhala, wamu wenu hawagoloki palugongu lwa Gerizimu kubwera shilii shashitenda Mtuwa Mlungu kawatekeleri na wamonga hawagoloki palugongu lwa Ebali kubwera shilii shashitenditi Mtuwa Mlungu kawapangili. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Migongu ayi miwili iwera uwega kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani muisi ya Kanaani yawalikala mulilaranda lya Yoridani pakwegera na mji gwa Giligali, kutali ndiri kulawa mumitera ya Morehi. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Mwenga hamuloki lushemba Yoridani mwingiri kuihala isi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kankuwapanana. Su pamwingira muisi ilii na kulikala, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />mulilori weri mtendi mashariti na malagizu ganuwapanana leru.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Pahala pa gweka pa kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />Aga ndo mashariti na malagizu galii gamfiruwa kuwera waminika kugajimira muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wetu kawapanana mwenga muihali mashaka goseri ga makaliru genu muisi ilii. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Mwenga mwagamiziyi nakamu pahala poseri vipinga vya wantu yamuwawinga waguwiriti wamilungu wawu, pamigongu na pavigongu na pasi pa mitera miwisi. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Muvipanti vitalawanda vyawu vya kutambikira na kuzibomolanga nakamu mpanda zawu za mabuwi. Muvyagamiziyi nakamu mumotu vinyagu vya mlungu Ashera na muvidumuli vinyagu vyawu vya kusonguluwa na mugawusiyi nakamu matawu gawu.<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />Namumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu gambira wantu wa Kanaani ntambu yawawaguwiriti wamilungu wawu. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Kumbiti mwenga mfiruwa kugenda pahala palii Mtuwa Mlungu hakapasyaguli. Mumakabila genu goseri hakatuli litawu lyakuyi na makawu gakuyi panu, aku ndo hamgendi kumguwira. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Kulii mwenga hamjegi tambiku zyenu za kulunguziwa nakamu na malaviwu na zaka za malaviwu genu na malaviwu genu gambira gamonga na wapanta njira wa wang'ombi wenu na wakondolu na wambuzi wenu. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Kulii kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mwenga pamuhera na kaya zyenu hamuliyi vintu viherepa vyamuvipata kwa kutenda mahengu, su hamunemeleri.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />Shaka shilii shashizaku, namtenda ntambu yatutenda vinu. Mpaka vinu mwenga mwankuguwira ntambu yamfira maweni. <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />Toziya mwenga hamweniyingiri muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawapanana, kulii mwenga hamuwezi kulikala kwa ponga. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Kumbiti pamloka lushemba lwa Yoridani na kulikala muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakagenda kuwapanana muhali, hakawapanani mwoyeri namgaziwa na wangondu wenu woseri yawawazyengeta, su mwenga hamulikali kwa ponga. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakapasyaguli pahala pakafira twenga tumguwiri. Pahala palii mwenga hamjegi malaviwu goseri galii ganuwalagalira mwenga kugajega, tambiku zyenu za kulunguziya nakamu na malaviwu genu na zaka zyenu za malaviwu na malaviwu genu ga usali zyamulilapira kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Kulii mwenga hamunemeleri kulongolu kwakuwi Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mwenga pamuhera na wana wenu wapalu na wadala, wantumintumi wenu wapalu na wadala, wantu wa Lawi yawalikala mumiji yenu toziya womberi wahera isi yawu weni ntambu yamuwera mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Mulilori weri namlaviya tambiku zyenu za kulunguziwa nakamu pahala poseri pamfira. <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />Kumbiti mwenga mulaviyi tambiku pahala Mtuwa Mlungu pakawasyaguliriti muisi yakagenda kuwapanana. Kulii mwenga mfiruwa mulaviyi tambiku zyenu za kulunguziwa nakamu na kutenda kila shintu ntambu yanuwalagaliriti.<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />Kumbiti mwenga muwera na ulekeru wa kulikitula wankanyama wenu na kuliya vinofu vyawu mumiji yenu. Ntambu yamfira, mwenga muweza kuliya vinofu vya nkanyama walii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawatekeleriti na kuwapanana mwenga. Wantu woseri yawajimiluwa kulongolu kwa Mlungu ama walii yawajimiruwa ndiri kulongolu kwa Mlungu su waweza kuliya vinofu avi, vinofu vya nkanyama yawamshema paa ama shinjapuli. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Namuliya mwazi, muyitiri pasi mwazi agu gambira mashi. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Pahala pamulikala, mwenga namuliya vintu virii vyamumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu. Namuliya zaka za viboga ama zaka ya divayi ama zaka ya lipaki lya mizyetuni ama zaka ya shipanta njira sha ng'ombi ama wakondolu na wambuzi ama tambiku za usali ama tambiku zyenu gambira tambiku zyamonga ama malaviwu gamonga galii. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Mwenga hamuviliyi vintu avi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pahala pakagenda kupasyagula. Hamuviliyi mwenga pamuhera na wana wenu wapalu na wadala, pamuhera na wantumintumi wenu wapalu na wadala na wantu wa Lawi yawalikala mumiji yenu. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Mulilori weri namuwalyaluwa wantu wa Lawi shaka shoseri shamulikala muisi yenu.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pakayongera isi kuliku yamuweriti nayu kwanja ntambu yakalagiliti, mwenga hamlongi kuwera mfira kuliya vinofu, su muweza kuliya vinofu shyasi shoseri shamfira. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Handa pahala pa kuguwira papasyagulituwiti na Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pawera patali nentu kulawa ukaya kwenu, mwenga mlekeziwa kulikitula ng'ombi ama kondolu ama mbuzi yoseri ulii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawapanana, mwenga muweza kuliya vinofu vyakuwi pahala pamulikala ntambu yakawalagaliriti. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Hamuviliyi vinofu avi ntambu yawamliya nkanyama yawamshema paa ama nkanyama shinjapuli. Muntu yakajimiluwa ama muntu yakajimiluwa ndiri kumguwira Mlungu, su kaweza kuliya. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Kumbiti namuliya mwazi toziya mwazi ndo ukomu, su namuliya ukomu pamuhera na vinofu. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Namuliya mwazi agu kumbiti muguyitiri pasi gambira mashi. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Pamliya ndiri mwazi, kila shintu hashifanikiwi kwa mwenga na kwa shiyuwuku shenu. Toziya hamtendi yagamfiriziya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Vintu vinanagala pamlaviya na tambiku zyenu za usali, hamuvitoli kuvijega pahala Mtuwa Mlungu pakagenda kupasyagula. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Mwenga mfiruwa kulaviya palii tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu, vinofu pamuhera na mwazi pashitalawanda sha kutambikira sha Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mwazi hamuguyimishiri pashitalawanda shakuwi Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, kumbiti mlekeziwa kuliya vinofu. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Mugajimiri kwa uwaminika kila shintu shanuwalagaliriti. Handa pamutenda aga, kila shintu hashiherepi kwa mwenga pamuhera na walera wenu mashaka goseri, toziya mtenda shilii shiheri na galii gagaherepa na yagawera teratera kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maberiziwu kuusu kuguwira vinyagu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />Mwenga pamwingira muisi ilii yamgenda kuhala, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawagamiziyi wantu wa isi yamgenda kuitola kwa makakala na kuikolamlima. <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakavyagamiziya kala, mwenga mulikali weri namuguwila milungu walii womberi waguwiriti, ntambu ayi hayiweri gambira mgomeziwu gwa kuwagomiziya. Namkosiya ntambu yawaguwira milungu yawu, su mwenga mguwiri kwa ntambu iraa ilii. <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Namjera kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu gambira wantu wa Kanaani ntambu yawawaguwira wamilungu wawu, womberi watenda kila ntambu ya vintu vyavifaa ndiri kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Walaviya tambiku kwa kuwalunguziya wana wawu pakutambikira pawu.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />Muliloli weri, mtendi kila shintu shanuwalagaliriti kushitenda. Namwongera shintu shoseri ama kupungula shintu shoseri.<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />Pakalawira mbuyi gwa Mlungu ama mtakulila ndotu pakati penu, kawalagalira na kuwapanana malangaliru ama makangashu, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />malangiliru ama makangashu pagalawira, shakapanu pakalonga, tuigenderi twakaiguwiri milungu yamonga, milungu yamuimaniti ndiri kwanja, <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />mwenga namuvipikanira visoweru vyawu. Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kafira kawoni handa mwenga mumfira nakaka kwa moyu gwenu goseri na kwa rohu yenu yoseri. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Mumfati na kumgohelera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu gweka yakuwi na kugajimira malagaliru gakuyi na kupikanira liziwu lyakuyi, mumtenderi na kulikolerana nayu. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Kumbiti mbuyi gwa Mlungu ayu ama yakatakulira ndotu, ulii yakawapotuziya mwenga munjira yakawalagaliriti Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu muigenderi, muntu ayu hakalagwi. Toziya katakuliti makontola kuusu Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawalaviyiti muisi ya Misri pamuweriti muumanda. Su kwa ntambu ayi ndo hamuwusiyi ukondola pakati penu.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />Payiwera mlongu gwaku gwa kwiwuka ama mwana gwaku mpalu ama muhinga gwaku, ama mdala gwaku yagumfira nentu ama ganja gwaku gwa kulitemana, pakakuzyangazyanga kwa bada pakalonga, Tugendi twakawaguwiri wamilungu wamonga, walii gwenga ama wambuyi wenu wawamaniti ndiri. <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />Wamu wawu hawakuzyangizyangi guwaguwiri wamilungu ya wantu yawalikala pakwegera na mwenga, ama milungu ya wantu yawalikala kutali na gwenga. <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />Nagumjimira kakuzyangizyangi ama kumpikanira ama kumwonera lusungu ama kufifa kwa virii vyakatenda. <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />Su gumlagi muntu ayu! Gwenga haguweri gwa kwanja kumlaga kwa kumgumanga kwa mabuwi, shakapanu wantu wamonga woseri hawafati. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Gumgumangi mabuwi mpaka kahowi! Toziya kajeriti kukutenda guleki kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawalaviyiti muumanda muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Su Waisraeli woseri pawapikanira aga, hawatiri, hapeni kuweri na muntu hakatendi ukondola gambira awu.<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />Pamulikala mumiji ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakagenda kuwapanana, mwenga memuwezi kupikanira <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />kuwera wantu wamu yawahera mahala pakati penu wankuwalongoziya wantu wawu mumiji yawu, pawalonga, tugendi twakawaguwiri wamilungu wamonga, wamilungu walii yamuimaniti ndiri kwanja. <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />Kwa shitwatira ashi, mwenga hamloliloli kwa bada, handa shitwatira ashi shanakaka na sha kukalalira shitendeka pakati penu, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />mwenga hamuwalagi wantu woseri mumji gulii. Hamuwalagi nakamu mifugu yawu na muilunguziyi nakamu miji yawu. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Shakapanu mjojoniri vintu vyoseri vya wantu yawalikaliti aku na muvilunguziyi kwa motu muluwaga lwa mji gambira tambiku ya kulunguziya nakamu kulongolu kwa Mlungu. Mji agu hausigali lupahera na hapeni gunyawiwi kayi. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Namtolamumtenderishiweri shaku, shintu shilii Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti shyagamiziwi, toziya mwenga pamtenda shilii shantakula, su yomberi hakaleki kuwera na maya kuusu mwenga na hakawawoneri lusungu na kuwatenda mwongereki nentu ntambu yakawalagiliti wambuyi wetu. <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakaweri na lusungu handa mwenga pamjimira malagaliru gakuyi goseri ganuwapanana leru na kutenda galii gagamfiriziya.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Namdaya gambira wantu wa isi zyamonga ntambu yawadaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />Mwenga mwawana wa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. Namulihanja hanja munshimba ama kumoga shikubuli toziya ya wantu yawahowiti ntambu yawadaya wamonga. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Mwenga mwawantu wananagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, pakati pa wantu woseri pasipanu, mweni kawasyaguliti muweri wantu wakuwi wa gweka.<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wankanyama yawakutenda gujimiluwi ama gujimiluwi ndiri mukumguwira Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />Namuliya shintu shoseri shashiwatenda mjimiluwi ndiri kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Muweza kuwaliya wankanyama awa: wang'ombi na wakondolu na wambuzi, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />wankanyama washemuwa vinjapuri na paa na kongoni na mbala na pofu na kondolu gwa kulugongu, <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />na kila nkanyama yakawera na kwatu zyazibagulika pakati na yakawuziya mumlomu shilii shakaliyiti na kushiliya kayi, su awa muweza kuwaliya. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Kumbiti namliya nkanyama yoseri ulii kwatu zyakuwi zibagulika ndiri pakati na kawuziya ndiri mumlomu shilii shakaliyiti. Namumliya ngamiya na sungura na pimbi, toziya wankanyama awa wawuziya mumlomu shilii shawaliyiti na kushiliya kayi kumbiti kwatu zyawi zibagulika ndiri pakati. Wankanyama awa paguwaliya hawakutendi gujimiluwi ndiri mukumguwira Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Viraa namuliya mtumbi, tembera kwatu zyakuwi zibagulika pakati kumbiti kawuziya ndiri mumlomu shilii shakaliyiti kala na kushiliya kayi. Namuliya wankanyama awa toziya jimiluwi ndiri mukumguwira Mlungu, su namuliya vinofu vyawu ama kushinkula mizoga yawu.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />Mwenga muweza kuliya ntambu zoseri za wasomba yawawera na makalakatu na malakalaka. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Kumbiti mwenga namuliya shiwumbi shoseri shashilikala mumashi, shilii shashiwera ndiri na makalakatu ama malakalaka, toziya paguliya hapeni gujimiluwi mukumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />Mwenga muweza kuwaliya wampongu yawajimiluwa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Kumbiti namuwaliya wampongu awa. Mpongu tai na furukombe na kapungu, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />shimbowi na kipanga na ntambu zoseri za kipanga, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />na ntambu zoseri za kunguru, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />na mpongu mbuni na lisisigila na tipitipi na ntambu zoseri za lisisigila, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />na lisisigila mdidika na mnandi na lisisigira mkulu, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />mumbi na mwari na mderi, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />kolongo na ntambu zoseri za koikoi na hudihudi na popo.<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Namuwaliya wang'ongolu woseri yawavuma pawagenda, yawawera na mbapatiru na yawawera na magulu msheshi, womberi wawera wakalaliru kwa mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Kumbiti wang'ongolu wamu yawawera na mbapatiru na yawajimilika, muweza kuwaliya.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />Namuliya vinofu vya nkanyama yoseri yakahowiti mweni. Mwenga muweza kumpanana muhenga yakalikala mumiji yenu su kaliyi, ama muweza kumshuwuzila muntu gwa isi yamonga toziya mwenga muwera wananagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">Namuteleka vinofu vya mwana gwa mbuzi mumaweri ga mawu gakuyi.<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru kuusu kulaviya zaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />Mtuli gweka zaka za mabenu goseri mumalambu kila shinja. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Shakapanu mugajegi mabenu aga pahala palii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pakapasyaguliti mwenga mumguwiri. Kulii mwenga hamuliyi kulongolu kwakuwi, zaka za viboga vyenu na divayi na lipaki lyenu lya mizyetuni na vinofu vya nkanyama yakawera shipanta njira kulawa mumifugu yenu ya wang'ombi na wakondolu na wambuzi. Mtendi hangu su mulifundi kumgohelera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu mashaka goseri. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Handa pahala palii Mtuwa Mlungu pakapasyaguliti mwenga mguwiri papawera patali kulawa ukaya kwenu, mwenga hapeni muwezi kujega zaka za mabenu genu galii Mtuwa Mlungu gakawatekeleriti. Su mwenga mtendi hangu, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />muzishuwuzi zaka za vintu avi mpati mpiya, su mtoli mpiya azi na muzijegi pahala palii pakumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu pakapasyagula. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Mpiya azi hamuwezi kuhemela shoseri shamfira, hamuhemeri vinofu vya ng'ombi na vinofu vya kondolu ama mbuzi na divayi ama ugimbi, mwenga pamuhera na kaya zyenu hamuviliyi vintu avi na kunemelera palii kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="DEU 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />Namuwalyaluwa wantu wa Lawi yawalikala pakati penu, womberi wahera lifungu lyoseri ama uhala wa isi. <verse eid="DEU 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Mulupeleru lwa kila shinja sha tatu, mwenga mjegi semu yimu muvintu lilongu vya mabenu genu na kugatula mumiji yenu. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Viboga avi haviweri vya wantu wa Lawi, toziya womberi wahera lifungu lyoseri pakati penu, wahenga na mshiwa na wakenja yawalikala mumiji yenu. Womberi walekeluwa kwiza kutola viboga vyawafira pavituluwa. Mtendi hangu su Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawatekeleri mumahengu genu goseri gamtenda.<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Mushinja sha Kwoyera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Walawi 25:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />Kila upeleru wa shinja sha saba, mwenga hamuwalekeziyi wawanda wenu woseri. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Mwenga hamtendi ntambu ayi, kila yumu gwenu yakamuwanditi Mwisraeli muyaguwi, nakamshonga nakamu shilii shakamuwanditi, viraa nakajera kumshonga uwanda awu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu mweni kamuwa lilekuwi nakamu. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Mwenga muweza kuwashonga wahenga uwanda yamuwawanditi, kumbiti mleki kuwashonga uwanda yamuwawanditi walongu wenu Waisraeli.<verse eid="DEU 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawatekeleri muisi yakagenda kuwapanana. Kwahera ata yumu gwenu yakagenda kuwera muhushu pakati penu <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />handa pamumjimira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu na kugajimira malagaliru goseri ganuwapanana leru. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Aga hagaweri hangu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawatekeleri mwenga ntambu yakalagiliti. Mwenga hamuwawandi wantu wa isi zivuwa, kumbiti mwenga hapeni muwandi kulawa kwa muntu yoseri. Viraa mwenga hamuwakolimlima wantu wa isi zivuwa, kumbiti wantu wa isi azi hapeni wawakolimlima mwenga.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />Handa pakawera muhusu pakati pa Waisraeli wayenu mumiji ya isi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu yakagenda kuwapanana, mwenga namuwera wayimi kuwatanga womberi. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Badala yakuwi, muweri na myoyu iherepa na muwawandi shyasi shawafira. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Gulilori weri liholu lidoda nalikwingira mumoyu gwaku na kulitakulira gamweni, shinja sha saba sha kuwalekeziya yawawanditi shapakwegera, su hapeni numuwandi muntu yoseri toziya hapeni kafiri kulipa mana shinja sha saba shakulekeziwa shapakwegera. Handa mwenga pamumuhola ndiri mlongu gwenu muntu gwa Israeli yakawera muhushu na kulema kumpanana shoseri, su yomberi hakamliliri Mtuwa Mlungu kuusu mwenga na shitwatira ashi hashiweri vidoda kwa mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Mumpanani mlongu gwenu muntu gwa Israeli yakawera muhushu kwa moyu guherepa, Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatekeleri mumahengu genu goseri na mukila shintu shamtenda. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Toziya wahushu hawaweri mashaka goseri muisi. Su neni nankuwalagalira mwenga muweri na myoyu iherepa kwa walongu wenu Waisraeli muisi yenu.<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />Handa mlongu gwenu Mwisraeli pakashuwuzuwa kwaku, yomberi hakakutenderi kwa mivinja sita, kumbiti mushinja sha saba hagumleki kaweri mlekeru. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Na gwenga pagumleka kagendi zyakuwi, su nagumleka kagendi mawoku hera. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Gumpanani kwa moyu guherepa shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakakutekeleriti: kondolu na viboga na divayi. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Muliholi kuwera mwenga muweriti wamanda pamuweriti aku Misri, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawakomboliti mwenga. Ndo mana nankuwapanana lilagaliru ali leru.<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />Kumbiti mmanda gwaku pakakugambira, neni hapeni mbuki kwaku, toziya kakufira gwenga pamuhera na kaya yaku na kafira kendereyi kulikala na gwenga, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />su gwenga hagumtoli kumjega kuligomi lwa numba yaku, pakawera palii paligomi, gwenga hagutoli sanziya na kumtobola likutu lyakuyi, shitwatira shilii hashimaniziyi kuwera yomberi hakaweri mmanda gwaku makaliru gakuyi goseri. Ntambu ayi gumtenderi viraa mmanda gwaku mdala. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Naguhinginika pagufiruwa kumlekeziya mmanda gwaku, toziya kakutendiriti mahengu kwa mivinja sita na gwenga gumpanana nusu ya shibenamgongu sha untumintumi. Handa pagumlekeziya yomberi, Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku hakakutekeleri mukila shintu shagutenda.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shipanta njira sha ng'ombi ama kondolu na mbuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />Gumtulili gweka Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku wapanta njira woseri washipalu ama washidala mushipinga shaku sha wang'ombi ama wakondolu na wambuzi. Nagutenda watendi mahengu ga kulima mumalambu, viraa naguwamoga mibayila. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Gwenga pamuhera na kaya yaku hamuwalikituli wankanyama awa na kuliya vinofu vyawu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, pahala palii Mtuwa Mlungu pakapasyaguliti mwenga mumguwiri mweni. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Kumbiti nkanyama yoseri pakawera na shidoda shoseri, pashiwera shibyeketu ama lwisi ama shidoda shoseri shikulu, mwenga namumlaviya tambiku kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Mwenga hamuwalikituli na kuliya vinofu vya wankanyama awa ukaya kwenu. Wantu woseri yawajimiluwa ama yawajimiluwa ndiri mukumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, waweza kuliya vinofu vya wankanyama awa ntambu yawaliya nkanyama paa ama shinjapuri. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Kumbiti namuliya mwazi gwa nkanyama, su mwenga muyitili mwazi agu gunyinyiriki gambira mashi pasi pamuwalikitula wankanyama awa.<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Kulawa 12:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />Mumgohelili Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mvini msambu gwa Pasaka kila shinja, mumwezi yagushemuwa Abibu. Mumwezi agu Mtuwa Mlungu kawakomboliti mwenga pashiru kulawa muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Su pamfira kuvina msambu agu, mwenga hamgendi pahala palii Mtuwa Mlungu pakapasyaguliti mumguwiri, palii mwenga mlaviyi mwana gwa ng'ombi ama kondolu ama mbuzi kulawa mumifugu yenu kaweri tambiku ya Pasaka. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Namuiliya tambiku ayi pamuhera na mabumunda yagalekeluwa simika, kumbiti kwa mashaka saba mliyi mabumunda yagalekeluwa ndiri simika, aga ndo mabumunda ga ntabiku toziya mlawiti Misri kamakam hera. Su mashaka goseri gamulikala hamuliholeri lishaka lilii lyamlawiti Misri. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Kwa mashaka saba muntu yoseri nakatula simika ukaya kwakuwi, viraa vinofu vya nkanyama yakalikituluwiti pamihi mulishaka lya kwanja navisigala mpaka mandawira. <verse eid="DEU 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />Namulaviya tambiku ya Pasaka mumiji goseri gulii Mtuwa Mlungu yakawapananiti, <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />kumbiti mlaviyi tambiku ayi pahala Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pakapasyaguliti mwenga mumguwiri. Mlaviyi tambiku ayi pamihi mshenji paguzyeta gambira shaka shilii shamlawiti Misri. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Muviteleki vinofu avi na kuviliya pahala palii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pakapasyagula mwenga mumguwiri. Shakapanu mandawira shilawu yakuwi, mwenga hamuwuyi mumalingu genu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Mashaka sita mwenga hamuliyi mabumunda yagalekeluwa ndiri simika na lishaka lya saba mwenga hamjojoniki kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, su namtenda lihengu lyoseri mulishaka ali.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa mabenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />Muwalangi majuwa saba mwenga pamwanja kubenanga viboga. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Shakapanu mvini msambu gwa mabenu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kwa kumlavilira tambiku gambira tambiku zyamonga ntambu yamtekelerituwiti. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Mwenga mnemeleri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mwenga pamuhera na wana wenu na wahinga wenu na wantumini wenu na Walawi yawalikala mumji gulii na wantu yawawera ndiri Waisraeli na mshiwa na wakenja walii yawalikala pamuhera na mwenga. Mjegi tambiku azi pahala palii Mtuwa Mlungu pakapasyaguliti mumguwiri. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Muliholi kuwera mwenga muweriti wamanda pamuweriiti Misri, su muliloli weri kugajimira malagaliru aga.<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa visasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />Pakupeta kala viboga vyenu vyoseri na kuzikama zyabibu zyenu, mvini msambu gwa visasa kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Mnemeleri mumsambu agu, mwenga pamuhera na wana wenu wapalu na wahinga wenu na wantumintumi wenu na Walawi na wantu yawawera ndiri Waisraeli na mshiwa na wakenja yawalikala mumiji yenu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Kwa mashaka saba mwenga mnemeleri msambu agu kumgohelera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pahala pakasyaguliti mumguwiri. Mwenga mnemeleri toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakagatekeleri mabenu genu goseri pamuhera na mahengu genu gamonga gamtenda.<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />Wapalu woseri pakati penu mwenga Waisraeli hawajojoniki kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu mara ntatu kila shinja pahala palii pakapasyaguliti mumguwiri. Mumsambu gwa mabumunda yagalekeluwa ndiri simika, msambu gwa kubenanga na msambu gwa kuwusiya malingu. Kila mpalu nakagenda mawoku hera kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Kila yumu gwenu hakalaviyi lifupu lyakuyi kulawirana Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamtekeleriti.<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muwatoza wantu pota kubagula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />Hamuwasyaguli watoza pamuhera na wakulu kulawa mumakabila genu mumiji yoseri muisi Mtuwa Mlungu yakagenda kuwapanana, womberi hawawatozi wantu pota kubagula. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Mwenga mfiruwa mtozi teratera, namtenda upendelewu kwa muntu yoseri ulii ama kuwanka swinda, toziya swinda itenda yawawera na luhala wasindi kutoza teratera na kupotuziya sitaka lya muntu muheri. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Mashaka goseri mtozi teratera, su mwenga hamwingiri na kutola kwa makakala isi Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakagenda kuwapanana.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />Naguyala mtera goseri gulii guweri mpanda ya mlungu mdala Ashera pakwegera na shitalawanda sha kutambikira shamgenda kumnyawira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Viraa namgolusiya mpanda ya mabuwi kuiguwira toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kaikalalira.<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="s">Kulaguwa kwa wantu yawaguwira vinyagu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />Namumlavilira tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, ng'ombi ama kondolu ama mbuzi yakawera na shidoda shoseri, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kazikalalira tambiku za ntambu azi.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />Muweza kupikanira kuwera mpalu ama mdala pakati penu yakalikala mumiji Mtuwa Mlungu yakawapanana, yomberi kawoneka katenda ukondola kwa kulilema lipatanu lilii Mtuwa Mlungu lyakalitenditi kwa mwenga, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />kwa kuwaguwira na kuwatendera wamilungu wamonga ama kuguguwira mshenji ama lyezi ama ntondu, vintu avi Mtuwa Mlungu kalagaliriti naviguwiruwa. <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />Handa muntu yoseri pakawagambira kwana muntu katenda hangu, su mwenga mushiloliloli weri shitwatira ashi. Na paiwoneka shisoweru shamgambirituwi shanakaka kuwera shintu shikontola shilawira kwa Waisraeli, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />su mwenga mumlaviyi muntu ayu kunja kwa mji na mumlagi kwa kumgumanga mabuwi. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Mwenga mlekiziwa kumlaga handa kwana wakapitawu wawili ama watatu yawawoniti ntambu yakatenditi muntu ulii. Nakalaguwa muntu ulii handa kwana ukapitawu wa muntu yumu hera. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Wakapitawu walii ndo hawanji kumgumanga kwa mabuwi, shakapanu wantu wamonga hawamgumangi mabuwi. Kwa kutenda hangu, ukondola awu haupeli pakati penu.<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />Pamonga hakulawiri masitaka mushizyungu shenu yagawera makulu kugatoza, gambira muntu pakamtenduwa muyaguwi ama kumlaga muyaguwi, pakatenda kwa kuvimana ama pota kuvimana. Pagalawira aga, mwenga mgendi pahala Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pakapasyaguliti mumguwiri, <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />na kulii hamuwagenderi watambika walii yawawera Walawi pamuhera na mtoza yakawera mulihengu shaka ashi, su mwenga hamlaviyi masitaka kulongolu kwawu, weni hawatakuli utoza wawu. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Mwenga hamtendi kulawirana na shilii womberi shawagenda kuwagambira pahala Mtuwa Mlungu pakapasyaguliti mumguwiri. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Mjimiri kulawirana na malagaliru gagawafunditi mwenga pamuhera na shilii shawamlila gagawapanani mwenga. Namgalambula shoseri mushilii shawamuliti. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Muntu yoseri yakawoneka kamshera ndiri mtambika ama mtoza yakatulituwiti kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, yomberi hakalagwi. Ntambu ayi hamumalili ukondola pakati penu mu Israeli. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Wantu woseri hawapikaniri na kutira, su hapeni watendi kayi shintu pota kulishera.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu kuusu wafalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />Mwenga pamwingira muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu yakawapanana muitoli kwa makakala na kulikala amu, handa mwenga pamtakula, twenga hatusyaguli mfalumi katukolimlima gambira isi zyamonga zyazituzyengeta ntambu yaziwera. <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />Mwenga muliloli weri kuwera muntu ulii yamgenda kumsyagula kuwera mfalumi, kaweri muntu ulii Mtuwa Mlungu yakamsyaguliti. Yomberi kaweri Mwisraeli, namusyagula muntu yakawera ndiri Mwisraeli kaweri mfalumi gwenu. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Pamuhera na hangu, mfalumi nakawera na wafalasi wavuwa kwajili ya shonta lyakuyi mweni, ama kuwatuma wantu wagendi Misri kuhemera wafalasi, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kakuberiziyani, nakamu namuwuya kayi Misri! <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Mfalumi nakayuga wadala wavuwa, toziya pakatenda hangu, wadala walii hawamtendi kaleki kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu. Viraa nakawera na ulunda uvuwa. <verse eid="DEU 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Yomberi pakawera mfalumi gwenu, kaweri na nakala ya shintora sha malagaliru aga gagatulituwiti na watambika wa shiyuwuku sha Lawi. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Nakala ayi hakaweri nayu na kuibetula mashaka goseri mumakaliru gakuyi, su kapati kulifunda mweni kumtira Mtuwa Mlungu gwakuwi kwa kuvijimira visoweru vya lilagaliru lilii na mashariti aga. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Aga hagamtendi yomberi nakalihola kuwera kaherepa nentu kuliku Waisraeli wayaguwi na kugalema malagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu kwa ntambu yoseri ilii. Su yomberi pamuhera na shileri shakuwi hawakolimlima mu Israeli kwa shaka shivuwa.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Lifungu lya watambika na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />Watambika woseri walii yawalawiti mulikabila lya Lawi, hapeni wahali isi yoseri ilii mu Israeli. Womberi hawalikali kuliya semu ya viboga virii wantu wamonga vyawalaviya tambiku za kulunguziya nakamu mumotu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Womberi hapeni wapananwi isi iweri yawu pakati pa walongu wawu Waisraeli, Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yakawera uhala wawu ntambu yakawalagiliti.<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />Lifungu ali haliweri lya watambika kulawa kwa wantu yawalaviya tambiku ya ng'ombi ama kondolu ama mbuzi. Womberi hawampanani mtambika ligulu lya nkanyama lya kulongolu na mankawu na virii vyaviwera mumtima mwa nkanyama. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Viraa hamuwapanani viboga vyenu vya kwanja kukamala mumalambu na divayi na lipaki lya mizyetuni pamuhera na mibayira yamuwamoga wakondolu wenu kwa mala ya kwanja. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Kulawa mumakabila genu goseri, Mtuwa Mlungu kalisyaguliti likabila lya Walawi waweri watambika wakuwi wa gweka.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />Handa Mlawi yoseri pakafira mweni kaweza kuwuka mumji woseri ulii wa Israeli na kugenda pahala Mtuwa Mlungu pakapasyaguliti wamguwiri, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />su pahala palii kaweza kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu gwakuwi handa watambika, gambira wapalu wamonga mulikabila lya Lawi walii yawatenda utenderu kulii pahala Mtuwa Mlungu pakapasyaguliti wamguwiri. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Yomberi hakaliyi lifungu lyakuyi lya tambiku na malaviwu, tembera yomberi kankuwaka mpiya kulawirana na mali za kaya yakuwi.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liberiziwu kuusu vitwatira vyakavikalalira Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />Mwenga pamsoka muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakagenda kuwapanana, namfata vitiba vikalaliru vya isi zilii. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Napawera na muntu yoseri pakati penu yakamlaviya tambiku mwana gwakuwi mpalu ama mdala mumotu, ama muntu yoseri yakatunga ama yakatenda uganga, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />ama muhawi ama muntu yakatakula na washamshera ama muntu yakawaluwa wantu yawahowiti wamtangi. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Muntu yoseri yakatenda vitwatira vya ntambu ayi, hakaweri shikalaliru kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, na kwajili ya vitwatira avi vya kukalalira, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kankuwawinga kulongolu kwenu, wantu wa isi ilii yamuigendera. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Kumbiti mwenga muweri waminika nakamu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagiru lya Mlungu kumjega mbuyi gambira Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Shakapanu Musa kendereyiti kawagambiriti, vipinga vya wantu wa isi ilii mwenga yamgenda kuitola kwa makakala, womberi wawapikaniraga waganga na yawatunga. Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hapeni kawalekeziyi mwenga kutenda hangu ntambu yawatenda womberi. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />Badala yakuwi Mtuwa Mlungu hakawajegeri mbuyi gambira neni kulawa pakati pa Waisraeli wayenu, mwenga mfiruwa kumpikanira.<verse eid="DEU 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />Mulishaka lilii lyamjojonikiti kulii kuluseleru lya Lugongu Sinayi, mwenga mumluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, twenga tufira ndiri Mtuwa Mlungu katakuli na twenga kayi, viraa tufira ndiri kuwona kayi motu agu mkulu palugongu Sinayi toziya tutira kuhowa. <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti, shilii shawatakuliti womberi shanakaka. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Neni haniwajegeri mbuyi kulawa pakati pawu. Hanumgambiri yomberi ntambu ya kutakula na yomberi hakawagambiri wantu kila shintu shanumgambira katakuli. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Handa yoseri yakavijimira ndiri visoweru vyangu virii mbuyi yakavitakula badala ya neni, neni namweni hanumtozi. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Kumbiti mbuyi yakatakula badala ya neni shintu shoseri shilii neni numlagalira ndiri katakuli, ama mbuyi yakatakula badala ya wamilungu wamonga, su mbuyi ulii hakalagwi.<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />Kumbiti mwenga muweza kulonga, twenga hatuwezi hashi kuvimana visoweru virii Mtuwa Mlungu kavitakula ndiri? <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Handa mbuyi gwa Mlungu pakatakula badala ya Mtuwa Mlungu, shintu ashi pashitendeka ndiri ama pashiwera ndiri nakaka, su hamuvimani kuwera visoweru virii vilawa ndiri kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Mbuyi ayu gwa Mungu hakaweri kankutakula kwa uwezu wakuwi mweni, su namumtira.<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Miji ya kutugira</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Mawalanga 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Yoshuwa 20:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />Pa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kuwagamiziya wantu walii isi yawu yang'enda kuwapanana mwenga, na pakuwawusiya kala mumiji yawu na mwenga kwanja kulikala munumba zawu, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />mwenga hamtuli gweka miji mitatu ya kutugira muisi yakagenda kuwapanana Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu mulikali. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Mbaguli miji mitatu muisi ilii, su kila muntu yakamlaga muntu gwingi kawezi kutugira mulumu lwa miji ilii. <verse eid="DEU 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Handa muntu yoseri pakamlaga muyaguwi pota kulihola, su kaweza kutugira mji gumu pa miji ilii kugalopola makaliru gakuyi kulii. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Kwa mfanu, muntu yakagenda na muyaguwi kuntundu kusola mbawu, yomberi pakawera kankukata mbawu, liwagu palisolopoka na kumkota muntu ulii na kumlaga, su muntu ulii hakawezi kutugira mumji gumu pa miji ilii kagalopoli makaliru gakuyi. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Handa utali wa mji gwa pakwegera kutugira paguwera kutali, mlongu gwa muntu ulii yakahowiti hakawezi kumtugusiya muntu ulii yakamlagiti muyaguwi na hakamlagi, tembera yomberi kapananituwiti ndiri lagaliru lya kulaga na walii waweriti ndiri wangondu kwanja. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Hangu ndo ntambu yanuwalagalira mtuli gweka miji mitatu.<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />Handa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pakawongera mbwega za isi yenu ntambu yakawalagiliti wambuyi wetu, na hakawapanani isi yoseri ilii yakawalagiliti wambuyi wetu, su mwenga mwongeri miji yamonga mitatu ya kutugira. <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />Mwenga pamuhera waminika kugajimira malagaliru goseri ganuwapanana, mashaka goseri pamuhera waminika na kugajimila mafundu gakuyi, Mtuwa Mlungu hakawapanani isi ayi. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Mtuli gweka miji ayi, su muntu yakahera na likosa pakiza kulaguwa muisi yenu ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakagenda kuwapanana mulikali, mwenga hapeni muweri na ukondola.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />Kumbiti muntu yoseri pakamkalalira mngondu gwakuwi, pakamnyatira na kumkangira na kumlaga, shakapanu pakatugira mji gumu mumiji ayi, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />su wazewi wa mji gulii yakalikaliti muntu ulii yakalagiti, hawawajegi wantu wamlaviyi muntu ulii yakalagiti kulawa mumji gulii yakatugiriti na kumjega kwa mlongu gwa muntu yakalaguwiti, su kamuwuziliri kwa kumlaga. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Nagumwonera lusungu muntu ulii yakalagiti. Mwenga hamumaliri ukondola kulawa mu Israeli, su mwenga pamtenda hangu, vitwatira vyenu vyoseri havigendi weri.<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbaka za makashu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />Mwenga pamwingira muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu yakagenda kuwapanana muikali, namuwusiya mabuwi ga mbaka za wapakwegera wenu, mabuwi ga mbaka gagatuliwituwiti kala pamakashu na Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakapitawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />Ukapitawu wa muntu yumu gutosha ndiri kumtoza muntu kaweri na likosa ama ukondola wa likosa lyoseri lilii lyakatenditi. Kumbiti ukapitawu wa wantu wawili ama watatu hera ndo gupikaniruwi. <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Handa muntu yoseri pakajera kulaviya ukapitawu wa upayira kumstaki muntu yoseri, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />su mkapitawu ayu pamuhera na muntu yawamstaki hawagendi pahala pa kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu pakapasyaguliti na hawayoweri na watambika pamuhera na watoza yawatenda lihengu mushaka shilii. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Watoza hawalori weri sitaka lilii na payiwoneka ukapitawu yaulaviwa uwera ukapitawu wa upayira na yumu gwa wantu walii kamstaki muyaguwi kwa upayira, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />su mwenga hamumtenderi muntu ulii ntambu yakafiriti kumtendera muyaguwi. Kwa kutenda hangu mwenga hamumalili ukondola pa Israeli. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Wantu wamonga hawapikaniri shitwatira ashi na hawatiri, su ukondola wa ntambu ayi hapeni ulawiri kayi pakati penu Waisraeli. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Mwenga namuwawonera lusungu wantu wa ntambu ayi. Lilagaliru haliweri kuwera muntu yakamlaga muyaguwi na mweni hakalagwi viraa na yoseri yakamtenduwa muyaguwi lisu na mweni hawamtenduwi lisu viraa, yoseri yakamtenduwa linu myaguwi na mweni hawamtenduwi linu viraa na yoseri yakamdumula liwoku muyaguwi na mweni hawamdumuli liwoku viraa, na yoseri yakalidumula ligulu lya muyaguwi na mweni hawamdumuli ligulu lyakuyi viraa.<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s">Malagaliru kuusu ngondu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />Mwenga pamgenda mungondu kulikomanga na wangondu wenu, pamuwawona farasi na mbutuka za kukweguwa na farasi na lishonta likulu kuliku shonta lyenu, mwenga namtira. Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawalaviyiti kulawa Misri hakaweri pamuhera na mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Pamberi pa kwanja kulikomanga ngondu, mtambika hakizi kulongolu na kuligambira shonta, <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />wapalu wa Israeli mpikaniri! Leru mwenga mwankugenda kulikomanga ngondu. Namuwatira wangondu wenu, viraa namfuwa moyu ama kushashatika kulongolu kwawu. <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakagendi pamuhera na mwenga kulikomanga ngondu na wangondu wenu, su kwajili yenu Mtuwa Mlungu hakawapanani mwenga ukanka.<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />Shakapanu wakulu wa shonta hawavigambiri vipinga vya shonta, handa kwana muntu yoseri kanyawa numba ya syayi na kaityeka ndiri, su kawuyi ukaya nakahowa mungondu na muntu yumonga kayityekuwi numba yaku. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Kwana muntu yoseri yakayaliti mizyabibu na kaliyiti ndiri mabwajubwaju gakuyi ga kwanja kulera? Handa kwanayu, su kawuyi ukaya nakahowa mungondu na muntu yumonga hakabenangi mabwajubwaju gakuyi na kunemelera divayi yakuwi. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Hashi kwana muntu yoseri yakamuhetiti mdala kumbiti kamuyuga ndiri? Handa kapanu, su kawuyi ukaya nakiza kuhowa mungondu, nakiza mpalu yumonga kumuyuga muheta gwaku.<verse eid="DEU 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />Shakapanu wakulu awa wa shonta hawendereyi kuwakosiya wantu, hashi, kwana muntu panu yakafuwiti moyu? Handa kwanayu, su kawuyi ukaya nakiza kuwatenda wayaguwi wafuwi moyu viraa gambira mweni ntambu yakafuwiti moyu. <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Wakulu wa shonta pawatakula kala na mashonta yawu, su womberi hawawasyaguli wakulu wa vipinga vya shonta hawawalongoziyi wantu.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />Mwenga pamsoka pakwegera na mji kuukangira, mwenga muwakosiyi wenikaya wa mji gulii handa pawawera kala kujisalimisha. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Handa wenikaya wa mji gulii pawafira ponga na kujisalimisha kwa mwenga, su wantu woseri yawawera kulii hawawatenderi mwenga na kutenda mahengu kwa kulazimishwa. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Kumbiti wenikaya wa mji gulii pawafira ndiri ponga kwa mwenga, pawasyagula kulikomanga ngondu na mwenga, su mwenga hamuuzyengeti mji gulii. <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pakawatenda mwenga muukangiri mji gulii, mwenga hamuwalagi kwa ligumba wapalu woseri, <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />kumbiti wadala woseri pamuhera na wananguta na wang'ombi na vyoseri vyaviweramu mumji. Mwenga hamtoli mifugu pamuhera na vintu vyoseri vyaviwera vya wangondu wenu, virii Mtuwa Mlungu vyakawapanani mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Hangu ndo ntambu yamgenda kuitendera miji yoseri yaiwera patali na isi yamgenda kulikala.<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />Kumbiti mwenga pamuikangira miji ilii muisi Mtuwa Mlungu yakagenda kuwapanana, mwagamiziyi kila shintu shashilikala. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Mwenga muwagamiziyi wantu woseri: Wahiti na Waamori na Wakanaani na Waperizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu ntambu yakawalagaliriti. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Handa mwenga pamuwalaga ndiri, womberi hawawafundi mafundu ga vitiba vya ukondola kwa kuwaguwira wamilungu wawu na kuwatenda mwenga mtendi vidoda kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />Pamuuzyengeta mji kwa shaka shitangara pamulikomanga ngondu, mwenga namuyidumula mitera ya mabwajubwaju. Mwenga mlekeziwa kuliya mabwajubwaju gakuyi kulawa mumitera ayi, kumbiti namuyiharabisiya mitera ayi toziya mitera ayi iwera ndiri wangondu wenu. <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Mwenga mlekeziwa kuidumula mitera yamonga na mbawu zyakuwi muweza kunyawa vintu pamuhera na mikweneru kuwatenda mwenga muwezi kukwena muvibambaza kuukangira mji.<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Muntu yakalaga pakamanika ndiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />Muntu pakawoneka kalaguwa kuntundu muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu yakagenda kuwapanana, na mwenga mumumana ndiri ulii yakalagiti, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />wazewi wetu pamuhera na watoza wenu hawawizi na kupima utali kulawa mtuguli gwa muntu ulii paguwera mpaka mji gwa pakwegera paguwera. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Shakapanu wazewi wa mji gulii yaguwera pakwegera na mtuguli gwa muntu ulii, womberi hawatoli mwana gwa ng'ombi yakakula nentu ndiri, ng'ombi ulii hakenitendi mahengu goseri galii. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />Womberi hawamtoli kugenda nayu pahala pa lularanda palushemba lulii lyaluyuma ndiri, lularanda alu lulimuwa ndiri ama kuyaluwa shintu shoseri, kulii hawamminduli singu ng'ombi ulii. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Watambika walikabila lya Lawi hawagendi viraa kulii, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, kawasyaguliti wamtenderi na kuwapetera mashi wantu kwa litawu lyakuyi na kwamuwa kila sitaka na ndewu zyazilawira. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Shakapanu wazewi kulawa mji ulii yauwera pakwegera na mtuguli gulii, hawanawi mawoku gawu pamwana gwa ng'ombi ulii yawamminduliti singu, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />womberi hawatakuli, twenga tumlaga ndiri muntu ayu, viraa tumwona ndiri muntu yakamlagiti muntu ayu. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu guwalekeziyi vidoda wantu waku Israeli yauwakomboliti kulawa Misri. Naguwatulila wantu waku likosa lya muntu ulii yakatenditi shitwatira ashi sha ukondola kwa kulaga, kumbiti guwalekeziyi. <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Kwa kutenda hangu, mwenga hamtendi shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakafira, viraa mwenga hapeni muweri na ukondola kwa ulagaji wa muntu ulii.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwayuga wadala mateka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />Mwenga pamgenda kulikomanga na wangondu wenu na Mtuwa Mlungu pakawatanga kuwakanki womberi, na mwenga pamuwatola mateka, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />handa yumu gwenu pakawona mdala mumateka walii kaherepa yakamfira, kafira kamuyugi, <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />su mpalu ayu hakafiruwi kamtoli mdala ulii kugenda nayu ukaya kwakuwi. Na mdala ulii hakamogi nvili zyakuwi na kuwembura ndoli zyakuwi, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />kavuli nguwu zyakuwi za mateka na kuvala nguwu zingi za wantu wa Israeli. Mdala ulii hakalikali ukaya kwa mpalu ulii kwa shaka sha mwezi gumu kuwadayira shiwembu tati na mawu gwakuwi, shakapanu mpalu ulii hakawezi kumuyuga. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Shakapanu pagufiriziwa ndiri na mdala ulii, hagumleki kagendi zyakuwi. Nagumshuwuza ama kumtenda gambira mmanda, toziya gwenga gugonjiti nayu.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhala wa Shipanta njira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />Payiwera mpalu kawera na wadala wawili, yomberi kamfira nentu mdala yumu kuliku mdala yumonga. Wadala woseri wawili wamlelera wana wapalu, kumbiti mwana mpalu shipanta njira kawera gwa mdala ulii yakamfira ndiri. <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />Mpalu ulii pakafira kugenda kubagula uhala wakuwi kwa wana wakuwi, yomberi kafiruwa ndiri kumpendereya mwana gwa mdala ulii yakamfira nentu kumpanana haki yakuwi ya uhala wa shipanta njira. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Mpalu ulii hakayambuli haki ya mwana shipanta njira, mwana gwa mdala ulii yakamfira ndiri kwa kumpanana mwana ulii mala mbili ya uhala wakuwi. Mwana mpalu ulii hakaweri lilangaliru lya kwanja lya makakala ga tati gwakuwi.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntemba yakawera ndiri mjimira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />Handa muntu yoseri pakawera na muntemba mbinta na mtundu, yakamjimira ndiri tati gwakuwi ama mawu gwakuwi pawamberiziya, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />su tati gwakuwi na mawu gwakuwi hawamjegi kwa wazewi kuligomi likulu lya mji. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Shakapanu womberi hawawagambiri wazewi wa mji, mwana gwenu kawera mbinta na mtundu na kalema kutujimira twenga, kawera na lwaliya na kulanda ng'anji ujimbi. <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Su wantu wa mji ulii hawamgumangi mabuwi mwana ulii mpaka kahowi. Kwa kutenda hangu hamumalili ukondola wa ntambu ayi pakati penu. Kila muntu mu Israeli hakashipikaniri shitwatira ashi na kutira.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru gamonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />Handa muntu pakatenda vidoda vya kumtenda kalaguwi na kalaguwa kwa kumumindula singu pamtera, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />mtuguru gakuyi nagulekuwa pamtera pashiru poseri, kumbiti hamugusiri lishaka lilaa lilii. Toziya kila muntu yakaminduluwa singu pamtera, su kapangiluwa kulongolu kwa Mlungu. Kwa njira ayi, mwenga hapeni muituli uhumba isi yenu yampananituwiti na Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />Pagumuwona ng'ombi ama kondolu gwa Mwisraeli muyagu kagamira, nagumleka kagamiri, kumbiti gumwuziyi kwa mlongu gwaku. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Kumbiti handa ukaya kwa mlongu gwaku ayu yakawera na mifugu ayi pawera patali ama gumumana ndiri yakawera na mifugu ayi, su gwenga hagumtoli nkanyama ayu kugenda nayu ukaya kwaku, kalikali kwaku mpaka mweni pakiza kumsakula, gwenga hagumuwuziyi kwakuwi. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Hagutendi ntambu ilaa ayi kuusu punda ama nguwu ama shintu shoseri shilii mlongu gwaku Mwisraeli pakashyagamiziya. Nakamu naguleka kumtanga.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />Paguwona punda ama ng'ombi gwa mlongu gwaku Mwisraeli kaguwa munjira, naguleka kumtanga mlongu gwaku ayu, gwenga hagumtangi kumgolusiya.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />Wadala nawavala nguwu za wapalu, viraa virii wapalu nawavala nguwu za wadala. Mtuwa Mlungu hakamkalaliri muntu yakatenda vitwatira vya ntambu ayi.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />Paguwona shitukulu sha mpongu pamtera ama munjira, shiwera na wana wa mpongu ama maligi na mpongu tembi kawagubikira wana wakuwi ama maligi gakuyi, nagumtola mpongu ulii pamuhera na wana wakuwi. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Haguleki mpongu tembi ulii kagendi zakuwi, kumbiti guweza kutola wana wa mpongu. Pagutenda hangu haguweri na makaliru matali.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />Pagunyawa numba yaku, gunyawi ukingu mumbwega mwa shitwiku, gwenga hapeni guweri na lawama muntu pakapatuka kulawa aku na kuhowa.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />Naguyala vimeru vyamonga pahala paguyaliti mizyabibu, paguyala vimeru vyamonga, gwenga hapeni gulekeziwi na Mlungu kubena mabenu kulawa muvimeru vyaguyaliti ama kubena mabwajubwaju kukama divayi.<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />Nagulima lirambu kwa kuwatawa ng'ombi na punda pamuhera.<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />Naguvala nguwu yainyawituwiti kwa mibayila ya kondolu yaipotutiwiti na shitambala shiherepa shifufu.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />Gutawi vifundu vya mishirashira mupembi zamsheshi za nguwu zaku.<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru kuusu vitwatira vya mpalu na mdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />Mpalu pakayuga mdala, shakapanu pakafira kumleka, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />pakayowera vitwatira vya upayira, kuwera mdala ulii kaweriti ndiri luyenja pakamuyugiti,<verse eid="DEU 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />Su walera wa mdala ulii hawatoli lishuka lyawayaliti mulisaga pawagonjiti shaka sha ndowa na kugenda nalu kwa wazewi palugomi likulu lwa mji, <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />na kuwagambira, tumyugiziyiti muhinga gwenu kwa muntu ayu, kumbiti vinu kamfira ndiri kayi. <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Yomberi katakuliti masitaka ga upayira kuusu muhinga gwenu pakalonga yomberi kaweriti ndiri luyenja pakamuyugiti. Kumbiti guloli! Avi ndo virii vyankulanguziya kuwera muhinga gwangu kaweriti luyenja! Guloli matoni ga mwazi mulishuka lyawatandiziyiti pawagonjiti pashiru lishaka pawamuyugiti! <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Shakapanu wazewi walii wa mji, hawamtoli mpalu ulii na kumsyatanga ntomondu. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Viraa hawamtozi muntu ayu fayini ya vipandi miya vya feza na kumpanana tati gwa mdala ulii toziya mpalu ulii kamsoniziya muhinga gwa Israeli. Na mdala ulii hakendereyi kuwera mdala gwakuwi na hapeni kamleki mumakaliru gakuyi goseri.<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />Kumbiti masitaka aga pagawera ga nakaka, mdala ulii kaweriti ndiri luyenja, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />womberi hawamjegi kuligomi lwa tati gwakuwi. Shakapanu wapalu wa mji gulii hawamgumangi mabuwi mdala ulii mpaka kahowi, toziya katenditi shintu sha kusoniziya mu Israeli kwa kutenda undiyandiya. Kwa kutenda hangu hamumalili ukondola pakati penu.<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />Mpalu pawambata ugoni na mda gwa muntu, woseri wawili mpalu na mdala walaguwi. Kwa kutenda ntambu ayi mwenga hamumalili ukondola pakati penu. <verse eid="DEU 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />Mpalu pakamwona muhinga yawamuhetiti, su pakagonja nayu, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />woseri wawili hamuwalaviyi kunja kwa mji na kuwagumanga mabuwi mpaka wahowi. Muhinga ulii mpaka kalaguwi toziya katenditi ndiri umatu su katanguwi tembera kaweriti mjini. Mpalu ulii mpaka kalaguwi toziya kamsoniziya muheta gwa wapakwegera gwakuwi. Kwa kutenda hangu mwenga hamumalili ukondola pakati penu.<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />Kumbiti mpalu pakaliwona na muhinga yawamuhetiti kwa kumbata kwa makakala, su mpalu gweka yakuwi hera hakalagwi. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Namumwazibu muhinga ayu, toziya katenditi ndiri shintu shoseri shashimtenda kaweri na ukondola yaumtenda kalaguwi. Shitwatira ashi shilifana na mtu yakamkangaliti muntu yumonga na kumlaga, <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />toziya mpalu ayu kambatiti kwa makakala muhinga ayu kuntundu aku, tembera kabotangiti kuluwa utanga na paweriti ndiri na muntu gwa kumtanga.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />Mpalu pakambata kwa makakala muhinga yakawera luyenja hakenihetuwiti, muntu yoseri pakamwona pakatenda hangu, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />muntu ulii hakampanani tati gwa muhinga ulii vipandi malongu muhanu ga madini ga feza, viraa hakamuyugi muhinga ulii yakambatiti kwa makakala. Yomberi hapeni kamleki makalilu gakuyi goseri.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />Mpalu yoseri nakagonja na wadala wa tati gwakuwi.<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Wantu yawajimiruwa ndiri kwingira pahala pa kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />Musa kendereyiti kuwagambira, Mpalu yoseri yakasaulitiwituwiti ama yakalikitulituwiti upalu wakuwi, yomberi nakajimiluwa kuguwira pamuhera na wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />Na mwana yoseri yakayuwukiti kwa tati yakawera Mwisraeli na mawu yakawera ndiri Mwisraeli, mwana ayu ama shileri shakuwi mpaka shileri sha lilongu, nakalekeziwa kuguwira pamuhera na wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />Muntu gwa Amoni ama muntu gwa Mowabu, vileri vyawu vyoseri mpaka vileri vya lilongu, womberi nawalekeziwa kuguwira pamuhera na wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Toziya womberi walemiti kuwapanana mwenga shiboga pamuhera na mashi ga kuranda pamuweriti mwanja kulawa Misri. Badala yakuwi wampananiti lihengu Baalamu mwana wa Beori kulawa aku Petihori kulii Misopotamiya, kawapangiri. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, kampikaniriti ndiri Baalamu, pangiru ayi igalambukiti kuwera matekeleru kwa wambuyi wetu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawafiriti. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Su mwenga nakamu mumakaliru genu namtenda shintu shoseri shakuwatanga Waamoni na Wamowabu wafanikiwi.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />Namuwakalalira Waedomu, womberi ndo walongu wenu. Viraa namuwakalalira Wamisri, toziya mwenga mulikaliti muisi yawu gambira wahenga. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Wazukulu wa wantu kulawa Edomu na Misri, walii yawalikala pakati penu, hawalekeziwi kuguwira pamuhera na wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mumalingu ga shonta gagajimiruwa na Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />Pamgenda kulikomanga ngondu na kubawila malingu genu, muliloli weri namtenda shintu shoseri shashiwatenda muweri wahumba. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Handa muwamu mwenu kwana muntu yoseri kawera muhumba toziya ya kulawa ulenji pashiru, muntu ayu hakalawi kunja kumalingu na hakalikali aku kwanjira mandawira mpaka pamihi, hapeni kalikali pakwegera na liringu. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Kumbiti payisoka pamihi hakogi mashi na mshenji paguzyeta hakawezi kuwuya kuliringu lyakuyi.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />Wanjagira waweri na pahala pa vyoo kunja kwawabawiliti malingu, kulii mewawezi kulibawira. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Mwenga hamuweri na ligembi, ali haliweri lya kubawira malindi na kukulilira mifi genu. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Mumalingu genu gaweri mananagala, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kankutyanga mumalingu genu su kawalopoziyi na kuwatenda mwenga muwakomangi wangondu wenu. Namleka shoseri shidoda pakati penu Mtuwa Mlungu kashiwoni, pamleka shidoda shoseri Mtuwa Mlungu hakawaleki.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru gamonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />Mmanda pakatugira kwa gwenga, nagumwuziya kwa mtuwa gwakuwi. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Gumlekiziyi yomberi kalikali pakati pa mwenga mumji yakagusyaguliti, su namumgaziya.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />Mwisraeli yoseri, mpalu na mdala, nakalekeziwa nakamu kuwera mndiyandiya pahala pa kuguwira. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Mpiya yoseri yaipatikaniti kwa vitendu vya undiyandiya, nayijeguwa Mnumba ya kumguwira Mlungu gwenu ama kulipira usali kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Mtuwa Mlungu kawakalalira woseri walii yawawera wandiyandiya.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />Pagumuwanda mpiya ama shiboga ama shintu shoseri shilii mlongu gwaku Mwisraeli, nagumtola liba pakawuziya uwanda yagumpananiti. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Guweza kutola liba pagumupanana uwanda muhenga, kumbiti mlongu gwaku Mwisraeli nagutola liba, su Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakakutekeleri mumahengu gaku goseri gagugenda kutenda muisi ilii yagugenda kuitola kwa makakala.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />Pagutula usali kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, nagukawa kuwusiya, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakaushongi kwa gwenga, su gwenga paguleka kuwusiya, haguweri na vidoda. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Kumbiti paguleka kutula usali hapeni guweri na vidoda. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Guloli weri kuwusiya usali yaguutuliti, toziya ulaa mweni guutuliti kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />Pagwingira mulirambu lya mizyabibu lya wapakwegera gwaku, gwenga guweza kuliya mazyabibu shyasi shagufira, kumbiti nagwapa na kutola zyabibu zoseri zilii mulijamanda lyaku. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Pagwingira mulirambu lya wapakwegera gwaku lyaliwera na viboga, gwenga guweza kupanyula mikuguwi na kuliya, kumbiti nagutola hengu na kuhenga viboga vyakuwi.<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s">Kuleka na kuyuga kayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />Payiwera mpalu kamyuga mdala na shakapanu kafiliziwa ndiri na yomberi toziya kawona kwakuwi shintu shifaa ndiri. Su mpalu ayu kamlembera malembu ga kumleka na kumpanana na kumuwusiya ukaya kwakuwi. <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Mdala ulii pakawuka ukaya kwa mpalu ulii, yomberi hakaweri mlekeru kuyuguwa na mpalu gwingi. <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />Kumbiti mpalu ayu gwa pili yakamuyugiti pakamlembera malembu ga kumleka na kumpanana na kumuwusiya ukaya kwakuwi, ama mpalu ayu pakahowa, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />su mpalu ulii yakamuyugiti kwanja, yomberi kalekeziwa ndiri kumuyuga kayi mdala ulii kuwera mdala gwakuwi, toziya yomberi kawera muhumba. Shitwatira ashi hashijegi ukondola muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawapanani muhali.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru gamonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />Mpalu yakaweriti mundowa ya syayi, nakagenda mungondu, viraa nakapananuwa lihengu lyoseri. Yomberi kaweri mlekeru kwa shaka sha shinja shimu, su kalikali ukaya na kunemelera na mdala gwakuwi yakamuyugiti.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />Gwenga pagumuwanda shintu shoseri mlongu muyagu Mwisraeli, nagutula libuwi kuwera poni pamabuwi galii mawili ga kusagila. Toziya kaya yaku wagatendera mabuwi galii kusagila viboga su wanyawi mabumunda ga kuliya.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />Muntu yoseri pakamtola Mwisraeli muyaguwi kwa lazima kumtenda kaweri mmanda gwakuwi ama kumshuwuza kwa muntu gwingi kaweri mmanda, muntu ayu yakamtoliti muyaguwi kwa lazima hakalagwi. Kwa kutenda ntambu ayi mwenga hamumalili ukondola pakati penu.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />Handa muntu pakawera na malweli madoda ga lukuli lwa nshimba, mwenga mfiruwa kulilora weri kutenda kila shintu shamlagalirituwiti na watambika wa shiyuwuku sha Walawi. Mtendi ntambu yanuwalagaliriti mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Namulyaluwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu ntambu yakamtenditi Miriyamu, mwenga pamuweriti mumwanja kulawa Misri.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />Pagumpanana uwanda wa shintu shoseri wapakwegera gwaku, gwenga nagwingira ukaya kwakuwi kutola poni, <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />kumbiti gumuheperi kunja kwa numba yakuwi na gumleki ulaa mweni kakujegeri poni ayi. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Handa yomberi pakawera muhushu, gwenga nagulikala pashiru poseri na lishuka lyakatuliti poni, <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />gumwuziliri kila lishaka pamihi su pashiru kawezi kuligibikira na kukuluwira matekeleru kwa Mlungu. Kwa kutenda hangu, Mtuwa Mlungu hakaherepeziwi na gwenga.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />Nagumzulumu shibaluwa muhushu na muhitaji, muntu ayu pakawera Mwisraeli ama muhenga yakalikala mumiji yenu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Gwenga gumpanani shibenamgongu kila lishaka pamberi mshenji kuzyeta, toziya yomberi ka muhushu na kashitumbira shibenamgongu ashi. Pagumpanana ndiri, yomberi hakamlili Mtuwa Mlungu, su gwenga haguweri na likosa.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />Walera nawalaguwa kwa vidoda vya wana wawu, viraa wana nawalaguwa toziya ya vidoda vya walera wawu. Kila muntu hakalagwi kulawirana na vidoda vyakuwi mweni.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />Namuwayima wahenga na washiwa galii goseri gagafiruwa kuwapanana. Viraa namtola nguwu ya mkenja kuwera poni. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Namulyaluwa kuwera mwenga muweriti wamanda muisi ya Misri na Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawakomboliti mwenga kulawa aku. Ndo mana nankuwapanana mwenga malagaliru aga.<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />Mwenga pambenanga mabenu genu kulirambu na kugaleka gamonga mulirambu lilii, mwenga namuwuya kugatola, kumbiti muwalekeri wahenga na washiwa na wakenja. Kwa kutenda hangu Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawatekeleri mumahengu genu goseri gamtenda. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Mwenga pamtikinyia mizeyituni yenu, namuwuya kayi kubenanga mabwajubwaju mumitambi yakuwi, kumbiti muwalekeri wahenga na washiwa na wakenja. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Pamwapa zyabibu, namwuya kusola zyabibu zyazisigaliti, kumbiti muwalekeri wahenga na washiwa na wakenja. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Namulyaluwa kuwera mwenga muweriti wamanda muisi ya Misri, ndo mana nankuwapanana malagaliru aga.<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />Musa kendereyiti kutakula, payiwera kwana ndewu pakati pa wantu wawili, womberi pawagenda kushizyungu, watoza pawatoza kuwera yumu kahera makosa na yumonga kawera na makosa, <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />handa ulii yakatozituwiti kapananuwa azabu ya kusyatanguwa ntomondu, su mtoza hakalagaliri ulii yakatozuwa kagonji pasi na kusyatanguwa ntomondu kulawirana na makosa gakuyi. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Ulii yakawera na makosa, hapeni kawezi kusyatanguwa ntomondu nentu ya ntomondu malongu msheshi. Pamumsyatanga nentu ya ntomondu malongu msheshi hamumsoniziyi mlongu gwenu.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />Mwenga namtula shintu shoseri pamlomu gwa ng'ombi pakakomanga viboga.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shashifiruwa kushitenda kwa mlongu yakahowiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />Handa walongu wawili wapalu walikala pahala tunga na yumu gwawu kahowa pota kuleka mwana mpalu, mdala gwa ulii yakahowiti nakayuguwa na muntu gwingi yakawera ndiri gwa kaya ilii. Mlongu gwa ulii yakahowiti, hakamuyugi mkenja ulii. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Mwana mpalu shipanta njira yakayuwuka, mwana ulii hakaweri gwa ulii yakahowiti su litawu lyakuyi nalyagamira hera Muisraeli. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Kumbiti mlongu gwa muntu ulii yakahowiti pakafira ndiri kumuhala mkenja ulii, su mkenja ulii hakagendi kulongolu kwa wazewi wa mji gulii na kulonga, mlongu gwa mpalu gwangu yakahowiti kalema kwendereza litawu lya mlongu gwakuwi Muisraeli, yomberi kalema kutenda shilii shashifiruwa kushitenda kwaneni. <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Shakapanu wazewi wa mji hawamshemi mlongu gwa ulii yakahowiti, su wayoweri nawu. Handa pakendereya kulema kumuhala mkenja ulii, <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />mdala mkenja ulii hakamfati kulii kwa wazewi awa wa mji, hakamvuli mlongu gwa ulii yakahowiti shilwatu shakuwi shimu na kumtemera mata kusheni na kumgambira, hangu ndo vyakafiruwa kutendwa muntu yakalema kwendereza litawu lya mlongu gwakuwi yakahowiti. <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Na litawu lya kaya yakuwi Muisraeli haliweri. Numba ya muntu yawamvuliti shilyatu.<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru gamonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />Wapalu wawili pawalikomanga na mdala gwa yumu gwawu pakamtanga mpalu gwakuwi kwa kumbata upalu wa ulii yakalikomanga na mpalu gwakuwi, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />mwenga hamuulikituli liwoku lya kumliwu lya mdala ulii, su namumwonera lusungu.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />Mwenga namuwera na vipimu vya kupimira vya ntambu mbili mumuhaku mwaku. Shipimu shimu shitopa na shamonga shiyewuka. Namuwera na vipimu vya upayira. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Viraa namuwera na ntambu mbili za vipimu vya kupimira ukaya kwaku, shikulu na shididini.<verse eid="DEU 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Mtumiyi vipimu na vipimu vyeni viweri na utopa uherepa su mpati kulikala makaliru matangara muisi yakagenda kuwapanana Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Woseri yawatenda vitwatira avi, woseri yawatenda kwa upayira su wawera likalaliru kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuli kuusu kuwalaga Waameleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />Namulyaluwa shilii Waamaleki ntambu yawawatendiriti mwenga pamuweriti mwanja kulawa muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Womberi wawakangaliti mwenga pamuweriti legilegi na washovu, womberi wawalagiti woseri yawajonditi kumbeli mumwanja. Womberi wamtiriti ndiri Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Su shaka Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pakawatenda mwenga mwoyeri kulawirana na kulikomanga na wangondu wenu woseri yawawazyengeta mwenga muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu yakawapananuwa mulikali amu, mwenga hamuwaagamizi Waamaleki woseri nawawera pasipanu.<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Malaviwu ga mabenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Musa kendereyiti kuwagambira, pamwingira kala na kuhala isi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawapanana iweri yenu na kulikala aku, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />mwenga hamtoli kila shambenanga shashiwera sha kwanja kukamala na kugatula mulijamanda na kugajega pahala palii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pakapasyaguliti mumguwiri. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Hagumgenderi mtambika yakamtenda mahengu mushaka shilii na kumgambira, leru nonga kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwangu kuwera ningira muisi yakawalagiliti wambuyi wetu kuwera hakawapanani.<verse eid="DEU 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />Shakapanu mtambika pakalitola lijamanda lilii kulawa mumawoku mwaku na kulitula pashitalawanda sha kutambikira sha Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />gwenga hagutakuli visoweru avi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mbuyi gwangu kaweriti Mwalamu yakayeritiyeriti aku na aku, shakapanu kaseleriti kugenda Misri na kalikaliti aku gambira muhenga. Mweni pamuhera na kaya yakuwi waweriti watangara ndiri pawalawiti aku, kumbiti womberi waweriti isi nkulu yaiwera na makakala na wantu wavuwa. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Wamisri watutenderiti kwa kutukakanika, watutabisiyiti na kutukakanira tutendi mahengu gakamala ga umanda. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Shakapanu tumliliriti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wazewi wetu, mweni katupikaniriti kulila kwa twenga na kuiwona ntabiku yatuweriti nayu, viraa kawoniti mahengu makamala gatuweriti naga. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu katulaviyiti aku Misri kwa makakala gakuyi makulu kwa kutenda mawuzawuza ga ntambu yingiyingi na vitwatira vya kulikangasha na kutiriziya pamuhera na malangalira. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Katujegiti panu na kutupanana isi ayi yaiwera na mbotu kwa kulima na mahamba ga kuwaliziya mifugu. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Su vinu nikujegera Mtuwa Mlungu viboga vya kwanja kukamala vyayaliti muisi ayi yakampananiti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">Shakapanu hagulituli pasi lijamanda lilii kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu na kumguwira. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Na gwenga hagunemeleri maheri goseri galii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, kakupanana gwenga pamuhera na kaya yaku. Su Walawi na wahenga pamuhera na woseri yawalikala pakati penu hawanemeleri pamuhera na gwenga. <verse eid="DEU 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />Kila pa mivinja mitatu, kila yumu gwenu hakalaviyi zaka ya mabenu genu goseri kwajili ya Walawi pamuhera na wahenga na washiwa na wakenja, su womberi wapati shiboga shawafira pawawera mumiji yenu. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Shakapanu gwenga hagulongi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, neni nulilaviya ukaya kwangu lifungu linanagala, niwapanani Walawi na wahenga na washiwa na wakenja, ntambu yagunagaliriti ntendi. Neni ndeka ndiri kujimira ama kulyaluwa malagaliru gaku kuusu kulaviya zaka. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Neni ndiyiti ndiri zaka yoseri paweriti nankudaya, nuyilaviyiti ndiri kunja kwa numba yangu neni paweriti muhumba na ndaviyiti ndiri zaka ayi kwa yawahowiti. Nikujimira gwee Mtuwa Mlungu gwangu, ntenda kila shintu shagunagaliriti. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Guloli pasi kulawa pahala paku pananagala aku kumpindi, guwatekeleri wantu waku Waisraeli na isi yagutupanana ntambu yaguwalagiliti wambuyi wetu, isi ilii yaiwera na mbotu kwa kulima na yaiwera na manyasi ga kuwaliziya mifugu.<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />Leru Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kankuwalagalira mwenga kugajimira mashariti na malagizu aga. Namulyaluwa kugajimira kwa moyu gwenu goseri na kwa rohu yenu yoseri. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Leru mwenga mtakula maweni kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu ndo Mlungu gwenu na hamulikali ntambu yakafira Mtuwa Mlungu na mwenga hamjimiri mashariti gakuyi na malagaliru gakuyi na malagizu gakuyi na kujimira kutenda kila shintu shakawagambiriti. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu katakula nakamu leru kuwera mwenga muwera wantu wakuwi wa gweka ntambu yakawalagiliti na mwenga mfiruwa kujimira malagaliru gakuyi goseri. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatendi mwenga kuwera isi yaigoheleruwa nentu kuliku isi zyamonga vyakaziumbiti. Mwenga hampananwi ujumi na ligoya na hamumaniki nentu. Mwenga hamuweri wantu wakuwi wa gweka Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, wantu yawawera wakuwi wananagala ntambu yakalagiliti.<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s">Lagiru za Mlungu zyazilembituwi mumabuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Su Musa pakaweriti na wakulu wa Israeli, kawagambiriti wantu hangu, “Mjimiri malagaliru goseri ganuwapanana leru. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Lishaka lilii pamloka lushemba Yoridani na kwingira muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawapanana, mwenga hamgolosiyi mabuwi makulu na kugatyeremeka. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Pamabuwi galii mwenga hamlembi visoweru vyoseri vya malagaliru goseri aga, pamwingira muisi yaiwera na mbotu kulima na manyasi maherepa ga kuliziya mifugu, isi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwa wambuyi wetu kawalagiliti. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Pamuhera kumwambu kulushemba lwa Yoridani, hamgolosiyi mabuwi viraa palugongu Ebali, ntambu yanuwalagaliriti leru na mugatyeremeka. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Aku hamumnyawiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, shitalawanda sha kutambikira pahala panu papawera na mabuwi galii gasongoluwa ndiri. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Shitalawanda sha kutambikira shoseri shilii shamumnyawira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, hashinyawiwi kwa mabuwi yagasongoluwa ndiri. Pashitalawanda ashi, mwenga hamumlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu, tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Hamumlaviliri tambiku za ponga na kuziliya palaa palii na kunemelera kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Mwenga hamlembi pota kufifa visoweru vyoseri vya malagaliru aga pamabuwi galii gamgatyeremikiti.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Su Musa pamuhera na watambika wa shiyuwuku sha Walawi, wawagambiriti wantu woseri wa Israeli, “Mnyamaliri! Mumpikiniri neni mwenga wantu wa Israeli. Leru mwenga muwera wantu wakuwi Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Mwenga mushijimiri shilii shakawagambira na mjimiri mashariti gakuyi gooseri na malagizu gakuyi yanuwapanana leru.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pangiru yailawirana na kulema kujimira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Mulishaka lilaa lilii Musa kawalagaliriti wantu na kulonga, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />pamloka kala lushemba lwa Yoridani, makabila aga ga Simiyoni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakari na Yosefu na Benjamini, hagagoloki palugongu lwa Gerizimu kubwera matekeleru. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Viraa makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi na Asheri na Zebuluni na Dani na Nafutari, hagagoloki palugongu lwa Ebali kubwera pangiru. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Walawi hawawagambiri wantu woseri wa Israeli kwa liziwu likulu.<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampangiri muntu yoseri yakanyawa shinyagu sha mabuwi ama shinyagu sha mbawu ama shinyagu sha kuyeyusha na kushigolosiya kwa bada kushiguwira. Vintu avi viwera vikalaliru kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:15">Wantu woseri walongi, yina haa!<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampangiri muntu yoseri yakamzalawu tati gwakuwi ama mawu gwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:16">Wantu woseri walongi, yina haa!<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampangiri muntu yoseri yakawusiya shimaniziwu sha mbaka sha wapakwegera gwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:17">Wantu woseri walongi, yina haa!<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampangiri muntu yoseri yakamlongoziya lwisi kagendi uwega wingi na kulii pakafiriti kugenda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 27:18">Wantu woseri walongi, yina haa!<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampangiri muntu yoseri yakapotuziya kuwapanana galii gagafiruwa kwa muhenga ama mshiwa ama mkenja.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:19">Wantu woseri walongi, yina haa!<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampangiri mpalu yoseri yakagonja na yumu ya wadala wa tati gwakuwi, toziya kankumsoniziya tati gwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:20">Wantu woseri walongi, yina haa!<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampangiri muntu yoseri yakagonja na nkanyama yoseri ulii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:21">Wantu woseri walongi, yina haa!<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampangiri muntu yoseri yakagonja na dada gwakuwi, dada gwakuwi yakayuwuka kwa mawu gwakuwi mweni ama dada yakayuwukiti kwa mawu gwa kambu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:22">Wantu woseri walongi, yina haa!<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampangiri muntu yoseri yakagonja na nahonga gwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:23">Wantu woseri walongi. Yina haa!<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />Mtuwa Mlungu muntu yoseri yakamlaga muntu kwa bada.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:24">Wantu woseri walongi, yina haa!<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampangiri muntu yoseri yakaluwiti swinda su kalagi muntu yakahera likosa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:25">Wantu woseri walongi, yina haa!<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampangiri muntu yoseri yakavijimira ndiri visoweru vya malagaliru Mlungu na kuvitenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:26">Wantu woseri hawalongi, yina haa!<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Matekeleru kwa wantu yawamjimira Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Walawi 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Liholu 7:12-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />Musa kendereyiti kuwagambira Waisraeli, handa pamjimira shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakafira na kuwera waminika kujimira kila shintu shanuwalagalira leru, mweni hakatukweniziyi nentu kuliku isi zyamonga pasipanu. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Handa pamjimira kutenda shilii shakalagalira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mwenga hampananwi matekeleru aga.<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakatekeleri pamuhera mjini,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 28:3">viraa hakawatekeleri mumalambu genu.<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawateleri mwenga kwa kuwapanana wana wavuwa na kuwapanana viboga vivuwa na wang'ombi wavuwa na wakondolu wavuwa.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawateleri mwenga muweri na mabenu gavuwa su muwezi kuliya.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatekeleri mwenga mukila shintu shamtenda.<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatendi mwenga muwakomangi wangondu wenu, hawakangali mwenga muuwega wumu, kumbiti womberi hawatugi kulawa kwenu muuwega saba.<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatekeleri mwenga kwa kuzimemiziya hanja zyenu za viboga, viraa hakawatekeleri mumahengu goseri gamtenda, hakawatekeleri viraa muisi yakagenda kuwapanana muhali.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />Mwenga pamjimira malagaliru gakuyi goseri galii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawapanana leru, pamulikala makaliru gakafira, su hakendereyi kututenda tuweri wantu wakuwi wananagala ntambu yakalagiliti. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Shakapanu wantu woseri pawawona mwenga kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kawasyagula muweri wantu wakuwi, wantu woseri pasipanu hawawatiri. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatendi mwenga mfanikiwi. Mwenga hamuweri na wana wavuwa na mifugu ivuwa na mabenu gavuwa kulawa mumalambu genu muisi ilii yakawalagiliti wambuyi wetu kuwera hakawapanani. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawavugulirani hanja zyakuwi ziherepa za mvula kulawa kumpindi na kutowa mvula muisi kwa shaka sha mvula na hakagatekeleri mahengu genu. Mwenga hamuwawandi wantu wa isi zivuwa, kumbiti mwenga hapeni mwanki shoseri kulawa kwawu. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Mwenga pamuhera waminika kugajimira malagaliru goseri ga Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, galii ganuwapanana leru, Mlungu hakawakweniziyi nentu mwenga kuliku isi zyamonga. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakavitendi vitwatira avi kwa gwenga, handa pagujimira shilii shanuwalagalira mwenga leru, ama pamlema kuwajimira wamilungu wamonga.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pangiru kwa wantu yawalema kujimira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />Kumbiti pagulema kutenda shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakawagambiriti mtendi, pamuhera ndiri waminika kujimira mashariti goseri na malagizu goseri galii ganuwapanana leru, Mtuwa Mlungu hakawapangiri ntambu ayi.<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawapangiri mwenga pamuhera mjini, viraa hakawapangiri mwenga mumalambu genu.<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawapangiri mwenga kwa kuwapanana ndiri viboga vivuwa na su muwezi kunyawa mabumunda.<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawapangiri mwenga kwa kuwapanana wana watangarandiri na viboga vyenu havipangiruwi, hakawapangiri wang'ombi wenu na wakondolu wenu nawongereka.<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakakupangiri mukila shintu shagutenda.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />Mwenga pamuvitenda vintu vikontola na kumlema Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi hakawapangiri mwenga msindi kutenda shintu shoseri na mpati shida na mshashatiki mukila shintu shamtenda, mpaka palii wangondu wenu pawawagamiziya nakamu. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu hakawajegeri malweri ga kutiriziya mpaka woseri pamwagamiya nakamu muisi ilii yamgenda kuitola kwa makakala. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawakomangi kwa kuwajegera ulweli gwa shifuwa shikulu na nshimba kupyupa na maputi na livuki likalipa na mvula kuleka kutowa, lipuga na lifukafuka. Vitwatira avi haviwapati mwenga mpaka mwagamili nakamu. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Kumpindi hakuyumi gambira madini ga shaba ntiti na pasipanu hapayumi gambira shuma. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakagalambuli mvula yaitowa muisi yenu iweri ubumu na muhanga hawitiki kulawa kulyera mpaka mwenga mwagamiri nakamu.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatendi wangondu wenu wawakomangi. Mwenga hamgendi kuwakangala wangondu wenu kupitira uwega wumu, kumbiti hamtugi kulawa kwawu kupitira wega saba. Na wantu woseri wa pasipanu hawatiriziwi pawawona virii vyaviwalawira kwa mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Mwenga pamuhowa, wampongu pamuhera na wankanyama wa kuntundu hawizi kuliya mitugulu yenu, hapeni kuweri na muntu gwa kuwawinga. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawakomangi kwa kutenda muweri na malipu yagatumbuka na kutukuta ntambu yakawatenditi Wamisri. Hakatendi muweri na vironda na upeli na nshimba kuwawa, mwenga hapeni mponi nakamu. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawakomangi kwa kuwatenda muweri na lukwali na hamuweri lwisi na mahala genu kupunganika. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Mwenga hamgendi kwa kupapasiya papasiya paluwala gambira lwisi, viraa hapeni mfanikiwi mumahengu genu. Hamzulumiwi kila mala na hapeni kuweri na muntu gwa kuwatanga.<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />Gwenga hagumuheti muhinga kumbiti muntu yumonga hakambati kwa makakala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 28:30">Hagunyawi numba, kumbiti hapeni gwingiri kulikala. Haguyali mizyabibu, kumbiti muntu gwingi hakabenangi. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Wangondu wenu hawawalikituli wang'ombi wenu mwenga pamuwalola, kumbiti hapeni mlawaliri ata shipandi shimu sha shinofu. Punda waku hawatoluwi kwa makakala kulawa kwa mwenga na hapeni wawawuziyi kwa mwenga. Wakondolu waku hawapananuwi wangondu waku pamuwawona na kwahera muntu yoseri ulii hakawalopoziyi. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Wana wenu wapalu na wadala hawalaviwi kwa wahenga kuwera wamanda, uganu mwenga pamulihola paluwala poseri kuwalolelera mewuyi, kumbiti hapeni muweri na makakala ga kutenda shoseri. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Wahenga wa isi yamuyimana ndiri halitoli viboga vyoseri mwenga mtenditi mahengu gakamala kulima,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 28:33">womberi hawawazulumu na kuwatabisiya nentu. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Mwenga hampati lukwali kwa vitwatira vyamgenda kuviwona. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakagatendi manung'unu genu na magulu genu gaweri na malipu madoda, mwenga hapeni muwezi kupona,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 28:35">malipu aga hagawaeneyi kwanjira kumtuwi mpaka kulwayu lwa magulu genu.<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatendi mwenga pamuhera na mfalumi gwenu yamumsyaguliti, kugenda muisi yamuimana ndiri mwenga na wambuyi wenu hamwenikali.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 28:36">Kulii mwenga hamuviguwiri vinyagu vyavinyawituwiti kwa mbawu ama mabuwi. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Muisi zilii Mtuwa Mlungu zyakawapalasiya, wantu woseri hawatiriziwi kwa virii vyavilawiriti kwa mwenga womberi pawawona, su womberi hawawazalawu na kuwazihaki.<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Mwenga hamuyali mbeyu zivuwa, kumbiti hambenangi kidogu toziya wanjombi hawaliyi viboga vyenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Hamuyali mizyabibu na kuyilolera weri, kumbiti hapeni mwapi zyabibu azi ama kulanda divayi yakuwi, toziya wavingongolu hawaliyi. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Hamuweri na mizeyituni pahala poseri muisi yenu, kumbiti hapeni muweri na lipaki ya kulityeremeka, toziya zeyituni azi hazituluki pamberi pa kukamala. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Mwenga hamwiwuli wana wapalu na wadala, kumbiti hapeni walikali na mwenga, toziya wangondu wenu hawatolowi kwa makakala kugenda nawu. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Wanjombi hawaliyi viboga vyenu mumalambu pamuhera na mahamba ga mitera yenu yoseri ya mabwajubwaju.<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />Wahenga yawalikala muisi yenu hawongereki kuwera walunda nentu pamuhera na makakala nentu, kumbiti maweni mwenga hamuweri wahushu na kuwera legilegi. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Womberi hawawapanani uwanda mwenga, kumbiti mwenga hapeni muweri na uwezu wa kuwapanana uwanda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 28:44">Womberi hawaweri waherepa na mwenga hamuweri wadoda.<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />Mwenga pamlema kutenda shilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu shakawalagalira mwenga mtendi, viraa pamlema kujimira mashariti gakuyi na malagizu gakuyi yagawapananiti, goseri aga hagawapati mwenga na kwendeleya kulawira kwa mwenga mpaka mwenga pamwagamira. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Kumbiti aga goseri hagaweri ukapitawu ga utoza wa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa mwenga na wiwuka wenu mashaka goseri. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kawatekeleriti mwenga mukila njira, kumbiti mwenga mumtenderiti ndiri kwa moyu guherepa na gwagunemelera. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Su hamuwatenderi wangondu wenu walii Mtuwa Mlungu yakawajega kuwakangala mwenga. Hamuweri na njala na kuyumuluwa na hapeni muweri na nguwu za kuvala na hapeni muweri na vintu. Viraa Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatendi mwenga mtabiki na mtendi mahengu gakamala mpaka mwenga pamwagamira nakamu. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakalijegi shonta kulawa kutali liwakomangi, wanjagira hawatakuli visoweru virii mwenga hapeni muvimani. Womberi hawawakangali mwenga gambira kapungu ntambu yakatenda. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Wantu walii hawaweri na sheni shashitiriziya. Womberi hapeni waweri na lusungu kwa wazewi ama wantemba na wahinga. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Womberi hawawalagi wang'ombi wenu na kuliya vinofu vyakuwi, viraa hawaliyi viboga vyenu na mwenga hamuhowi toziya hapeni muweri na shintu sha kuliya. Su hapeni wawalekeri viboga ama divayi ama lipaki lya mizyetuni ama mifugu yenu, mwenga hamuhowi kulawirana na njala. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Wangondu wenu hawaizyengeti mumiji yenu yoseri namlawa muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakagenda kuwapanana. Womberi hawabomolangi vibambaza virii mwenga muliholiti vyankuwalolera weri.<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />Wangondu wenu pawaizyengeta miji yenu, mwenga hamuweri na njala nentu na malawiranu gakuyi hamuwalagi na kuliya vinofu wana wenu walii Mtuwa Mlungu yakawapananiti. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Ata muntu mpoli na yakaleleruwiti weri, hakamwimi mlongu gwakuwi ama mdala gwakuwi yakamfira ama mwana gwakuwi yakasigala, vinofu virii. <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />Viraa hapeni kambaguliri ata yumu gwawu shinofu sha wana wakuwi yakagenda kuwaliya. Hapeni msigali na shintu shoseri shaka ashi wangondu wenu pawawazyengeta na kuwatabisiya mumiji yenu yoseri. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Ata mdala ulii yakawera mkulu, na yakaleleruwa weri na mlunda, yomberi hakatendi ntambu iraa ilii. <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />Wangondu pawaizyengeta miji yenu yoseri, mdala ulii hakaweri na njala nentu, kwa bada hakamliyi mwana mdidi yakamuyuwula, hakaliyi viraa kondo lilii lyalilawa pa kwiyula mwana. Kayi hakaliyi na kumuyima ata mpalu gwakuwi yakamfira nentu, viraa hakawayimi ata wana wakuwi.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />Handa pamuhera ndiri waminika kugajimira malagaliru goseri galii ganugalemba mushintora ashi, viraa pamgaholera ndiri litawu lya kulikangasha lya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />su Mtuwa Mlungu hakawazibu mwenga kwa kuwajegera mwenga pamuhera na viyiwuku vyenu ntabiku nkulu na makomangu makulu ga malweli yagapona ndiri. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Hakawajegeri malweri galii yamgatiriti pamuweriti muisi Misri na hapeni mponi. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakajegeri malweri ga kila ntambu na makomangu gamonga galii gakanduwa ndiri mushintora ashi sha malagaliru mpaka mwenga pamlaguwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Tembera mwenga muwera wavuwa gambira ntondu za kulyera, kumbiti hamuweri wadidini hera toziya mumjimira ndiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakaherepeziwiti kuwatendera vintu viherepa na kuwatenda muweri wavuwa, ntambu iraa ayi hakaherepeziwi kuwajegera ntabiku na kuwagamiziya. Mwenga hamuwusiwi muisi yamgenda kuitola kwa makakala. <verse eid="DEU 28:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawapalasiyi muisi zoseri, kulawa wega umu gwa pasipanu mpaka uwega umonga, aku mwenga hamuitenderi milungu ilii yainyawituwiti kwa mbawu ama mabuwi, milungu ilii mwenga pamuhera na wambuyi wetu hawenimani. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Hapeni muweri na ponga pahala poseri palii pa kwoyera. Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatendi myoyu yenu iweri na lyoga, hapeni muwezi kuwona weri na hamshashatiki mumoyu. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Mashaka goseri mwenga hamuweri na lyoga kuwera wangondu wenu hawawalagi. Hamuweri na lyoga paluwala na pashiru. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Myoyu yenu hayiweri na lyoga. Mandawira mwenga hamlongi, mbaka meyiweri pamihi, paluwala papasoka mwenga hamlongi, mbaka meyiweri mandawira. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawawuziyi mwenga ku Misri kwa mtumbwi mkulu, mwanja gweni kalagiliti kuwera hapeni mgendi kayi. Aku Misri hamjeri kulishuwuza maweni kwa wangondu wenu su muweri wamanda, kumbiti kwahera muntu hakawahemeri.<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu na Waisraeli muisi ya Wamowabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Avi ndo visoweru vya lipatanu lilii Mtuwa Mlungu lyakamlagaliriti Musa kulitenda na Waisraeli muisi ya Wamowabu, kwa kwongera Mtuwa Mlungu kwanja katenditi lipatanu nawa kulugongu Holebu.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Musa kawashemiti pamuhera Waisraeli woseri na kawagambiriti, mwoniti maweni Mtuwa ntambu yakamtendiriti mfalumi gwa Misri na wakulu wakuyi na wantumintumi wakuyi pamuhera na isi yoseri. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Maweni mwenga mwoniti makomangu ga kutiriziya na mawuzawuza makulu na malangalira makulu Mtuwa gakagatenditi. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Kumbiti mpaka leru, Mtuwa Mlungu hakeni wapananani mahala ga kuvimana na masu ga kuwona na makutu ga kupikanira! <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Kwa mivinja arobaini, Mtuwa kawalongoziyiti kushiwala, nguwu zyenu zyamvaliti zisakaliti ndiri, viraa vilwatu vyenu visakaliti ndiri mumagulu mwenu. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Mwenga mliyiti ndiri mabumunda ama kulanda divayi ama shiloweru shoseri shilii, su mwenga mpati kuvimana kuwera Mtuwa ndo Mlungu gwenu. <verse eid="DEU 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Na pamsokiti pahala panu, mfalumi Sihoni gwa aku Heshiboni na mfalumi Ogu gwa aku Bashani, wiziti kulikomanga nkondu na twenga, kumbiti tuwakomangiti na kuwakanka. <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />Tuitoliti isi yawu na tuibaguliti na kugapanana makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi na nusu tulipananiti likabila lya Manasi. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Hangu mwenga muweri waminika kulijimira lipatanu ali, su mpati kufanikiwa mumahengu genu goseri.<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />Leru mwawoseri mwenga mgoloka kulongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. Wakulu wa makabila na wazewi wenu na wakulu wenu na wapalu woseri, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />wadala wenu na wana wenu na wahenga yawalikala pakati penu, walii yawasakulira mbawu na kuwatekera mashi. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Mwenga mgoloka panu leru su Mtuwa Mlungu katendi lipatanu na mwenga, na mwenga mlijimili lipatanu lyakuyi, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />handa hakawalanguziyi nakaka leru kuwera mwenga muwera wantu wakuyi na mweni kawera Mlungu gwenu, ntambu yakawalapiriti mwenga pamuhera na wambuyi wetu Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakobu. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Nankutenda ndiri na mwenga gweka yenu hera, lipatanu ali pamuhera na kulirapa, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />kumbiti ntenda lipatanu ali pamuhera na walii yawawera pamuhera na twenga leru kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, viraa ntenda pamuhera na shiyuwuku shenu hasheniyuwuki.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />Mliholi ntambu yatulikaliti muisi ya Misri na ntambu yatugenditi mwanja muisi zyamonga. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Mwenga mwoniti vinyagu vyawu vya kukalaziya vya wamilungu yaisongolituwiti kwa mitera na mabuwi na vityelemikiwiti malembiziwu ga madini ga feza na zahabu. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Mulikali weri, kwahera mpalu ama mdala ama lukolu ama likabila lyoseri lilii pakati penu yakagoloka panu leru na hakagalambuki kumleka Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu na kugenda kuwaguwira wamilungu wa isi zyamonga. Shitwatira ashi hashiweri gambira lushigira lwa shimeru shashikula pakati penu na kulera usungu pamuhera na mabwajubwaju gakalipa. <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Mloli weri kuwera kwahera muntu yoseri panu leru yakapikanira malapiru aga na shakapanu kalitakulila mweni mumoyu kuwera hakaweri salama, ata ubinta pagwendereya kwakuwi. Ntambu ayi yaiwagamiziyi woseri, waheri na wakontola. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu hapeni kamlekiziyi muntu gambira ayu, maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu na weya yakuwi havimyakiri muntu ayu, pangiru zoseri zyazilembituwi mushitabu ashi hazimwizili na Mtuwa Mlungu hakamwagamiziyi nakamu muntu ayu. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />Mtuwa hakamtuli gweka muntu ayu kulawa pakati pa makabila goseri ga Israeli, kapatuwi na madoda kugenderana na pangiru zoseri za lipatanu lyalilembitwi mushitabu ashi.<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />Muviyiwuku vyavizaku, walera wenu pamuhera na wahenga kulawa isi ya kutali hawawoni ntambu Mtuwa Mlungu kayijegeriti isi ayi madoda na ntabiku. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Isi yoseri hayilunguziwi na mabuhi ga madini ga baruti na munu, hailunguli na hapeni kuweri na shintu shashiyaluwa mumalambu, viraa magugu hapeni gameri. Isi yenu hayiweri gambira miji ya sodoma na Gomora. Adima na Seboimu, miji ilii Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakayagamiziyiti kwa maya gakuyi. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Wantu wa isi zimonga hawakosiyi, iwera hashi Mtuwa Mlungu isi ayi kayitenda ntambu ayi? Kwa ntambu gaa kaweriti na maya makulu? <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Na lyankula haliweri hangu, toziya wantu wa Mtuwa walilekiti lipatanu lyawalituliti na Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu shaka pakawalaviyiti muisi ya Misri, <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />womberi wagenditi kuitendera na kuwaguwira wamlungu wamonga, wamlungu walii waimaniti ndiri kwanja, viraa Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti ndiri wayiguwiri. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti na maya nentu kwa wantu wa isi ayi na katenditi pangiru zoseri zilii zyazilembitwi mushitabu ashi ziwapati. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawatupuliti kulawa muisi yawu kwa maya na nkalaliru nentu, kawawasiti muisi yamonga ntambu yawawera aku leru.<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />Vitwatira vya bada ndo vya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, kumbiti galii gagagubutulitwi ndo gatwenga pamuhera na shiyiwuku shetu mashaka goseri, su tuvitendi visoweru vyoseri vya malagaliru aga.<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s">Kuwawuziya Waisraeli kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Musa kandereya kulonga, niwapanana usyagula, matekeleru ama pangiru. Vitwatira avi vyoseri paviwalawira mwenga, mwenga pamulikala muisi zilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pakawapalasiyiti, mwenga hamuliholi usyagula yanuwapanana. <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />Handa mwenga pamuhera na viyiwuku vyenu pamuwuyira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kwa myoyu yenu yoseri kugajimira malagaliru gakuyi ganuwapanana leru, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawawoneri lusungu. Hakawawuziyi mwenga kulawa muisi zilii zyakawapalasiyiti na hakawatendi kayi muweri nyanyi. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Ata mwenga pampalasiwa kutali pasipanu, Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawajojoniri pamuhera na kuwawuziya, <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />su muhali kayi isi ilii mambuyi wetu walikaliti. Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatendi mfanikiwi nentu na muweri wavuwa kuliku wambuyi wenu ntambu yawaweriti. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, hakawatendi mwenga pamuhera na viyiwuku vyenu muweri na miyoyu ya kujimira su mumfiri mweni kwa miyoyu yenu yoseri na kwa rohu zyenu zoseri, su mwenga mwendereyi kulikala muisi. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakatendi pangiru zoseri azi ziwapati wankondu wenu yawawakalariti na kuwatabisiya, <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />shakapanu mwenga hamumjimiri Mtuwa Mlungu na kugatenda malagaliru gakuyi ganuwapanana leru. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawatendi mwenga mfanikiwi mukila shintu shamtenda, hamuweri na wana wavuwa na wang'ombi wavuwa na malambu genu hagalaviyi viboga. Toziya hakaweri na nemeleru kuwatendera vintu viherepa ntambu yakawatendiriti wambuyi wenu, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />handa pamushijimira shilii shakawalagaliriti mushitendi na kutenda malagaliru gakuyi na mabeliziwu gakuyi yagalembitwi mushitabu ashi sha malagaliru na kumuwuyira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kwa miyoyu yoseri na kwa rohu yoseri.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />Malagaliru ganuwapanana leru gakamala ndiri kwa mwenga kugamana, viraa gawera ndiri patali na mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Gawera ndiri kumpindi ata mwenga mkosiyi, gaa hakakweni kumpindi kutujegera su tupati kugapikanira na kugajimira? <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Viraa gawera ndiri kumwambu kubahari ata mwenga mkosiyi, gaa hakaloki bahari katujegeri su tupati kugapikanira na kugajimira? <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Mwenga mfiruwa ndiri kutenda hangu toziya malagaliru gakuyi ga pamuhera na mwenga. Mwenga mugamana na gawera mumahala genu, su vinu mwenga mugajimiri.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />Leru nankuwapanana mwenga usyagula, msyaguli maheri ama madoda ama ukomu ama kuhowa. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Handa pamugajimira malagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, galii ganuwapanana leru na pamumfira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu na kugatenda goseri na kugajimira malagiru na amuri na toza zakuyi zoseri, su hamulikali na kwongere. Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu hakawatekeleri muisi yamgenda kuhala. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Kumbiti pamgalambuka na kulema kugajimira aga, pamgenda kuwaguwira wamlungu wamonga, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />nankuwaberiziya vinu, hamwagamiri nakamu. Hapeni mulikali kwa shaka shitangala muisi yamgenda kuhala, kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Nizishema mpindi na pasipanu ziweri kapitawu kwa mwenga leru, niwapanani kusyagula ukomu ama kuhowa, matekeleru ama pangiru. Kumbiti mwenga msyaguli ukomu, mwenga pamuhera na viyiwuku vyenu su mulikali. <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />Mwenga mumfiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mpikinili liziwu lyakuyi na kuwela pamuhera na yomberi. Toziya kwa kutenda hangu hakulanguziyi kuwera hamuweri na makaliru gatangala na hamulikali muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu yakawalagiliti kuwera hakakupanani wambuyi wenu Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakobu.<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s">Musa kankumsyagula Yoshuwa kawalongoziyi Waisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Musa kendereyiti kuyowera na Waisraeli woseri, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />kawagambiriti, vinu neni wera na vinja miya na ishilini, weza ndiri kuwalongoziya mwenga. Mtuwa Mlungu kang'ambiriti kuwera hapeni ndoki lushemba Yoridani. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, hakawalongoleri na kuwagamiziya wantu woseri yawalikala muisi za aku, su mwenga muhali isi yawu. Yoshuwa hakaweri mlongoziya gwenu handa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakanagaliriti kala. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Mtuwa hakawagamiziyi walii ntambu yakawagamiziyiti Sihoni na Ogu wafalumi wa Waamori na wantu wawu. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatendi mwenga muwakanki wantu wa isi zilii, hamuwatendi ntambu yaniwalagaliliti <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Muweri wagagamala na makakala, namuwatira womberi toziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu kankugenda pamuhera na mwenga. Mweni hakawatangi na hapeni kawaleki.<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Shakapanu Musa kamshemiti Yoshuwa, kamgambiriti kulongolu kwa wantu woseri wa Israeli, gugangamali na moyu mkulu, toziya gwenga haguwalongoziyi wantu awa kugenda kuitola kwa makakala isi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu yakawalagiliti wambuyi wetu. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu mweni hakawalongoziyi na kuwera pamuhera na mwenga, mweni hakawatangi na hapeni kawaleki.<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msomi shitabu sha lagiru kila shinja sha saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Su Musa kagalembiti malagaliru aga mushitabu na kuwapanana watambika wa lukolu lwa Lawi, walii yawaweriti na lihengu lya kupapa Lisanduku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa, pamuhera na wakulu woseri wa Israeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Shakapanu Musa kawalagaliriti, kila shinja sha saba hashiweri shinja sha kuwalekeziya wantu woseri uwanda, mushisomi shitabu ashi kwa liziwu likulu mumsambu gwa visasa. <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />Mushisomi shitabu ashi sha lagiru kwa wantu wa Israeli pawiza kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu pahala palii pakapasyaguliti wamguwiri. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Muwajojoniri wantu woseri. Wapalu na wadala na wana na wahenga yawalikala mumiji yenu, su kila muntu kapikaniri visoweru avi kulifunda kumgohelera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu na kulilola weri kujimira visoweru vya lagiru ali. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Kwa kutenda hangu, shiyiwuku shenu shilii hashenipikaniri malagaliru aga ga Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu su wapati kupikanira na kulifunda kumgohelera Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, mushaka shoseri shamulikala muisi yamgenda kuitola kwa makakala kumwambu kwa lushemba Yoridani.<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagalira ga upereru ga Mtuwa kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />“Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, lishaka lyaku lya kuhowa lyapakwegera. Gumshemi Yoshuwa, mwizi pamuhera Muliringu Linanagala numpanani malagaliru. Su Musa na Yoshuwa wagenditi Muliringu Linanagala,” <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawalawiriti womberi kulii mumpanda ya lihundi lyaligolokiti paligomi lya Liringi Linanagala.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, gwapakwegera kuhowa na paguhowa kala, wantu hawaleki kuwera waminika kwaneni na hawaleki kujimira lipatanu lyantenditi pamuhera nawa.” <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Pagalawira aga, neni haweri na maya nentu kwawu, haniwaleki kuwera pamuhera na womberi na hawagamiziwi. Ukontola uvuwa na ntabiku haziwiziri ata wavimani kuwera madoda aga gawapata toziya Mlungu gwawu kapamuhera nawu ndiri. <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Nakaka hapeni niwatangi toziya watenda vitwatira vikontola na kwanja kuwaguwira wamlungu wamonga.<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />Vinu gulembi lwimbu alu, guwafundi wantu wa Israeli su haluweri ukapitawu wa neni kwa womberi. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Panuwajega muisi yaiwera na mbotu kulima na mahamba gaherepa ga waliziya mifugu, ntambu yanuwalagiliti wambuyi wawu kuwera haniwapanani, womberi hawaliyi na kwikuta na kunenepa. Kumbiti hawawagalambukili wamlungu wamonga na kuwaguwira. Su hawanemi neni na kulilema kulijimira Lipatanu lyangu lyantenditi nawa. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Madoda gavuwa na ntabiku hazilawiri kwa womberi. Pakulawira aga, viyiwuku vyawu haviliholi lwimbu alu na haluweri mkapitawu kwa weni hapeni walyaluwi. Ata vinu haneni wajegeli kwingira muisi ilii yanililagiliti kuwapanana, nigamana maholu gawalihola kutenda pawalikala kulii.<verse eid="DEU 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Su lishaka liraali Musa kalembiti lwimbu alu na kawafunditi wantu woseri wa Israeli kuluwimba.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />“Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamalagaliriti Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni, gugangamali na guweri na moyu mkulu, toziya haguwalongoziyi Waisraeli kugenda muisi yanuwalagiliti kuwapanana, su neni haweri pamuhera na gwenga.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Musa pakamaliliti kulemba shitabu sha lagiru ali Mtuwa Mlungu gakamlagaliriti, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />kawagambiriti Walawi yawaweriti na lihengu lya kupapa Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />Mtoli shitabu ashi sha lagaru na mushituli pakwegera na Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu, su shiweri ukapitawu kwa mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Nankutakula aga toziya nivimana kuwera wantu awa wawera na ubinta nentu. Paiwera wamlemiti Mtuwa Mlungu neni pawera mkomu, hayiweri hashi pahowa kala? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Muwajojoniri kulongolu kwaneni wazewi woseri pamuhera na wakulu woseri wa makabila genu, su kuwagambira visoweru vya lwimbu alu, kumpindi na pasipanu ziweri kapitawu kwa womberi. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Toziya nivimana kuwera pahowa kala nakaka mwenga hamuweri wakontola na hamgalambuki na kulema kutenda goseri ganuwalagaliriti mtendi. Na mushaka shashiza aku, Mtuwa hakawakalaliri nentu kulawirana na vitwatira vyenu vya ukontola.<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Shakapanu Musa kalwimbiti lwimbu alu uganu waisraeli woseri pawapikanira.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />Mpindi ipikaniri visoweru vyaneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">Gupikanili, gwee pasipanu, visoweru vyantakula.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Mafundu gangu na gatuluki handa mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">visoweru vyangu vituluki gambira mangami.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">Handa manyeminyemi muvimeru vididika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">handa mvula ya folafola mumihamba miwisi.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Toziya hanilibweri litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">na mwenga mlongi, Mlungu gwetu ndo mkulu.<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />Mtuwa Mlungu ndo litalawu lya uponeru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">mahengu gakuyi ndo makamilika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">njira zakuyi zoseri ndo za nakaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Yomberi ndo Mlungu mwaminika na kahera likosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">yomberi katenda mirandu miheri na ya nakaka.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Kumbiti mwenga waminika ndiri kwa yomberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">mwenga mwawana wakuyi ndiri kayi toziya ya ukontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">mwenga mwashiyuku shikontola na shipotoka.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Muweza ashi kumlipa hangu Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">mwenga wantu wazigizigi na mwahera mahala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Hashi, yomberi ndo tati gwenu ndiri yakawaumbiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Yakawatenditi na kuwagangamaziya?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Muliholi mashaka gapititi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">muliholi vinja vya viyiwuku wavuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">muwakosiyi watati wenu wawagambiri virii vyavilawiriti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">muwakosiyi wakulu wenu womberi hawawagambili.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Yakawera kumpindi nentu pakawapananiti maisi uhala wawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">pakawabaguliti wantu woseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">katuliti mbaka toziya ya maisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">teratera na walanga ya wana wa Waisraeli <verse eid="DEU 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />kumbiti Mlungu kalisyaguliriti wantu wa Yakobu kuwera uhala wakuyi.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />Kawawoniti muisi ya shiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">ntundu hera zyaziwera na lipuga likulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">Kawaloliti na kuwatula weri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">kawalolera handa shiloleru sha lisu lyakuyi.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Gambira kapungu ntambu yakawafunda wana wakuyi kuguluka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">na kuyalika mpampantiru zakuyi su kuwakolera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">na kuwapapa pampindi kwa mbapatiru zakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">Ayi ndo ntambu Mtuwa kayitula Israeli kulawa kuguwa. <verse eid="DEU 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Mtuwa Mlungu mweni kawalongoziyiti wantu wakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">na paweriti ndiri na mlungu yumonga gwa kumtanga.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />Kawapitiziyiti mupahala pampindi pa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">na womberi waliyiti viboga vya mumalambu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">Kawapananiti lwashi mumatalawu walawaliri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">na lipaki kulawa litalawu likamala.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Kawapanananiti jibini na maweri ga wang'ombi na wambuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">waweriti na wakondolu na wambuzi wanenepa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">vipinga vya mifugu ya Bashani na mbuzi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">Kawapananiti nganu iherepa nentu na divayi ya syayi walanditi.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />Wantu wa Israeli wakuliti kuwera walunda, kumbiti waweriti mtiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">wanenepiti, wawera na mitima mikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">shakapanu wamlekiti Mlungu yakawanyawiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">wamzalawu Litalawu lya ulopuziya wawu.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Wamtenditi Mlungu kaweri na weya na maya makulu kwa kuwaguwira wamlungu wamonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">na kumkwankanira kakalali kwa mirandu yawu ya kukalaziya<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Wawatambikiriti washamshera yawaweriti ndiri Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">wawagenderiti wamlungu walii yawaimaniti ndiri nakamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">wamlungu wa syayi yawalawiriti mashaka ga pakwegera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">wazewi wawu wayipananiti ndiri ligoya nakamu.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Walyaluyiti Litalawu yakawawumbiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">wamlyaluwiti Mlungu yakawiwuliti.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakaguwoniti mlandu agu kawalekiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">toziya wamkalaziya wana wakuyi, wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="DEU 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti, hapeni niwatangi mwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">shakapanu moni upeleru wawu hawuweri hashi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Toziya womberi ndo shiyiwuku shipotuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">wana yawahera waminika woseri ulii.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Pamuhera na vinyagu vyawu, womberi wantenda nkalali nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">neni weri na weya kwa shintu shawashishemiti wamlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">wamlungu walii yawawera ndiri wamlungu nakaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">Su neni hanuwatendi wawoni weya kwa shashiwera ndiri wantu, haniwakalaziyi kwa kuyitendera isi ya wazigizigi.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Maya gangu gaka gambira motu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">galunguziya nakamu kila shintu pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">hayilunguziyi mpaka kulilindi litali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">hayilunguziyi miyanjiru ya migongu.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />Hanjegi madoda gavuwa kwa womberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">haniwagumi na misali yangu yoseri.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Hawondi kwa njala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">hawalaguwi kwa nshimba kupyupa kukulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">Haniwajegi wankanyama yawawera na malinu gakalipa wawakangali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">na njoka yawawera na usungu wawalumangi.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Nkondu ijega kuhowa kuvuwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">na mnumba lyoga likolamlima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">wantemba wapalu na wadala hawalaguwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">ata yawakonka na wazewi wana nvilisa.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Nongiti, haniwagamiziyi womberi nakamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">su wantu nawawahola kayi pasi panu.<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Kumbiti hapeni niwalekeziyi wankondu wawu walitumbi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">kuwera womberi wawakanka wantu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">neni namweni ndo yaniwagamiziyiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">na neni Mlungu wera ndiri mumirandu ayi<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Israeli iwera isi yahera mahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">wantu wakuyi wahera luhala mngati mwawu.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Handa mewaweri na luhala mewavimani iwera hashi wasinditi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">mewavimani upeleru wawu hauweri hashi.<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Muntu yumu kaweza hashi kuwakanka wantu elufu yimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">ama wantu wawili waweza hashi kuwakanka wantu elufu lilongu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Ayi ndo toziya Litalawu lyawu liwasa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Toziya Mtuwa kawaleka<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Ata wankondu wawu wavimana kuwera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">litalawu lyawu lyahera likakala handa litalawu lyetu.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Wankondu wawu handa mizyabibu yaiyalitwi Sodom na Gomora,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">zyabibu zakuyi ndo zyabibu zyaziwera na usungu na zikalipa,<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Divayi yawu iwera gambira usungu wa njoka,<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, nilihola kuwera shilii shaniwatendiriti wankondu wawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:34">su nankuhepera shaka shifaa sha kuwakomanga womberi.<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Mbuziliru ndo ya neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">neni hambuziliri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">shaka magulu gawu pagatyerebuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">toziya lishaka lyawu lya kwagamira lisoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">upeleru wawu wapakwegera nentu.<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawateteya wantu wakuyi tembera wana likosa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">na kuwawonera lusungu wantumintumi wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">shaka pakawona makakala gawu gapera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">kwahera yakasigaliti mtatiluwa ama muntu mlekeru.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu hakawakosiyi wantu wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">Wakoshi wamlungu wamonga yamlitumbiriti?<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Wakoshi wamlungu yawaliyiti malaviwu genu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">na divayi na tambiku zyenu za kulanda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">Su wimuki wawatangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">mleki wamlungu ayi iweri walolera wenu!<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />Mloli kuwera neni namweni ndo Mlungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">kwahera gwingi kumbiti neni hera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Neni ndaga na kutula ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">ntenda na kulopoziya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">na kwahera muntu yakaweza kundewelera.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Nyasula liwoku lyangu kumpindi na kulilapa toziya neni na Mlungu yanilikala mashaka goseri,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />handa pamumona nankukuwa ligumba lyangu lyaling'eleng'eta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">na kutalipisiya liwoku kutoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">haniwawuziliri wankondu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">haniwakomangi walii yawankalalira.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Misali yangu hayisumiziyi mwazi gwa wankondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">ligumba lyangu haliwalagi woseri yawampingira neni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">Hapeni nimleki ata yumu yakalikomanga na neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">ata yawatenduwa pamuhera pa walii watatilwa na wanamakakala hawahowi.<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />Mnemeleri, mwe maisi pamuhera na wantu wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">kwakuyi hakawuzilili kwa mwazi wa wantumintumi wakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">Hakawuziliri wankondu wakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">na kutenda ukoluniziya kwa isi na wantu wakuyi.<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Musa pamuhera na Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni, wimbiti lwimbu alu, su Waisraeli woseri walupikiniri.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Visoweru vya kumalilila vya Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Musa pakamaliliti kuwafunda wantu wa Israeli mafundu goseri aga. <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />“Kawagambiriti, namlyaluwa mafundu goseri ganuwafunditi leru. Muwafundi kayi wana wenu, su womberi wagafati na waweri waminika kugajimira mafundu goseri ga Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Toziya mafundu aga hera ndiri kumbiti ndo ukomu wenu, kwa mafundu aga mwenga hamulikali makaliru gatangara muisi yamgenda kuikangara kumwambu mwa lushemba Yoridani.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Lishaka liraali, Mtuwa Mlungu Kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />gukweni mumfatanu gwa lugongu alu lwa Abarimu mulugongu lya Nebo, muisi ya Mowabu, pakwegera na mji gwa Yeriku, gwakailoli isi ya Kanaani yang'enda kuwapanana Waisraeli wahali. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Shakapanu haguhowi kulaaku kulugongu na haguweri na wambuyi waku gambira kaka gwaku Aruni ntambu yakahowiti mulugongu Hori na kuwera pamuhera na wambuyi wakuyi, <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />toziya mwawoseri wawili mlekiti kuwera waminika kwaneni pamuweriti kulongolu kwa Waisraeli mwenga pamuweriti kumashi ga Meriba, pakwegera na mji gwa Kadeshi, mushiwala sha Sini, na toziya muupanana ndiri ligoya unanagala wangu muwamu mwa Waisraeli. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Su haguyiwoni isi ilii kwa kutali, kumbiti hapeni gwingili muisi ilii yang'enda kuwapanana Waisraeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Musa kankutekelera makabila ga Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Ayi ndo tekelela yeni Musa, muntu gwa Mlungu, kawatekeliti Waisraeli pamberi pa kuhowa kwakuyi.<verse eid="DEU 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Kalongiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">“Mtuwa Mlungu kiziti kulawa lugongu Sinayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">katulawiriti kulawa lugongu Seyiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">kayilangaliriti kulawa lugongu Parani.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Kalawiriti pakati pa maelufu ga wantumintumi wa kumpindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">na motu gwaguwakiti muliwoku lyakuyi lya kumliwu.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Nakaka Mtuwa Mlungu kawafiriti wantu wakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">na kawaloleraga wananagala wakuyi woseri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">Su wananagala wakuyi wazigendiriti njira zakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">na kugajimira malagiru gakuyi.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Musa katugambiriti tuyijimiri lagiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">maisi getu ndo luhanja lwa luhala.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawera mfalumi kwa Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">shaka wakulu wawu pawaliwoniti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">na makabila goseri pagajojonikiti.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Musa kalongiti kwa likabila lya Rubeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">Rubeni kalikali, nakahowa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">na wantu wakuyi nawawera wadidika.<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />“Kwa likabila lya Yuda Musa kalongiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">gwee Mtuwa Mlungu gupikanili kulira kwa likabila lya Yuda pawaluwa utanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">gumwuziyi kayi kwa wantu walii wamonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Gulikomangili kwa mawoku gaku kwajili yakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">gulitangi likabila vya Yuda kwajili ya wankondu wakuyi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />“Toziya ya Lawi, Musa kalongiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">Tumimu yaku na Urimu waku gumpananiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">muntu uliya yakaweriti mwaminika kwa gwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">Gumjeriti aku Masa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">na kusindana na yomberi kumashi ga Meriba.”<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Kawagambiliti watati wakuyi na wamawu wakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">Walawi wamuwiti kuwaleka wazewi wawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">wawalyaluwiti walongu wawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">wawamana ndiri ata wana wawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">toziya watenditi malagaliru gaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">na kugajimira mapatanu gaku.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Na wawafundi wiwuka wa Yakobu malagalira gaku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">na wawafundi wantu wa Israeli lagiru gaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">Walawi watumiziyi ubani kulongolu kwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">na hawalaviyi tambiku ya kulunguziya nakamu pashitalawanda shaku sha kutambikira.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Gwee Mtuwa gugatekeleri makakala gawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">gugajimili mahengu ga mawoku gawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">guwagamiziyi nakamu wankondu wawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">nakuwaleka wagoloki kayi.<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Kwa likabila lya Benjamini, kalongiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">“Ali ndo likabila lyakalifira na kulilolera Mtuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">na kulilolera paluwala poseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">womberi walikala pasi pa ulolera wakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">Hakalikali mumawoku gakuyi na kumlolela.<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Kwa likabila lya Yusufu kalongiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">Mtuwa kayitekeleri isi yakuyi kwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">manyeminyemi kulawa kumpindi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">na kawatekeleri kwa mashi kulawa pasipanu.”<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Isi yawu itekelerwi kwa mshenji yagutenda mabwajubwaju gawuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">kwa ulunda wa mabwajubwaju gaherepa kila shipindi,<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />kwa mabenu gaherepa ga migongu migona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:15">na mabenu gavuwa ga migongu migona.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Isi yawu imemi goseri yagawera maheri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">itekererwi kwa uheri wa Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">ulii yakalawiriti mushiputira shashilungula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Matekeleru aga gawizili wantu wa likabila lya Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">toziya yomberi kaweriti mkulu muwamu mwa walongu wakuwi.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Yosefu kaweriti na makakala handa ng'ombi shipalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">magoli gakuyi handa ganyati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Na kwa magoli aga hakagakomi maisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">ata yagawera upeleru wa pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">hangu ndo ntambu yaviwela vipinga elufu lilongu vya Efulaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">hangu ndo ntambu yagawera maelufu ga Manasi.<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />“Kwa likabila lya Zabuloni na Isakari kalongiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">Zabuloni mfanikiwi mumahengu genu ga kutenda biyashara mubahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">na Isakari ulunda wenu wongereki mukaya zyenu.”<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Hawawashemeri wantu kumigongu yawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na aku wantu hawalaviyi tambiku zyazifiruwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Toziya womberi hawapati ulunda wawu kulawa kubahari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na hanja zawu mumuhanga gwa kumpwani.<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />“Kwa likabila lya Gadi kalongiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Kakwiswi Mlungu yakampananiti Gadi semu nkulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Gadi kanyatira gambira simba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">yakapanyula liwoku ama shipalakasa sha mtuwi.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Womberi walisyaguliriti isi ina mbotu kwajili yawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">pahala papatulitwi gweka kwajili ya wakulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Wakulu wa wantu pawajojonikiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">womberi wagajimiriti malagaliru galii Mtuwa Mlungu gakawapananiti Waisraeli.<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Kwa likabila lya Dani kalongiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">Dani ndo mwana gwa simba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">yakaguluka kulawa isi ya Bashani.<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Kwa likabila lya Nafutali kalongiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">gwee Nafutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">yamumemiti matekeleru ga Mtuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">isi yenu yakusika kulitanda Galilaya.<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Kwa likabila lya Asheri kalongiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">Asheri katekelerwi kuliku wana wa Yakobu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">Na gupananwi upendelewu pamuhera na walongu waku woseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">na isi yaku iweri na ulunda wa lipaki lya mitera ya mizyetuni.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Miji yenu ilolerwi kwa magomi makulu ga shuma na shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:25">na mashaka goseri gulikali kwa uponeru.<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Musa kamaliriti kwa kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">Mwee wantu Israeli, kwahera mlungu gambira Mlungu gwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">yomberi kapita kulyera kwiza kukutanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">na yomberi kakwiza kulawa kumahundi muukwisa wakuyi.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Mlungu gwa mashaka goseri ndo utugira wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">makakala gakuyi gawoneka pasipanu mashaka goseri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">Kawawingiti wankondu kulongolu kwenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">na kawalagaliriti muwagamiziyi woseri.<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Su wantu Waisraeli hawalikali kwa ponga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">shiyiwuku sha Yakobu gweka yawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">muisi yaimemiti viboga nduu pamuhera na divayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">isi ilii lyera lyakuyi litulusiya mangami.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Mtekelerwa mwenga Waisraeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Gaa yakawera gambira mwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">wantu yamlopoziyituwiti na Mtuwa Mlungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Mweni ndo mlolera na utanga wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">na ligumba lyaliwajegera ukanka!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Wankondu wenu hawizi pawananaga kulongolu kwenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">na mwenga hamuwatimbangi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Shakapanu Musa kalawiti kulularanda lwa Mowabu na kukwena kugenda kulugongu lwa Nebo palugongu lwa Pisiga kwagulawira mshenji aku Yeriku. Kulii Mtuwa Mlungu kamlanguziyiti isi yoseri. Mji gwa Gileadi mpaka Dani, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />Nafutali yoseri na isi yoseri ya Efurayimu na Manasi na isi yoseri ya Yuda, mpaka bahari ya Mediterania, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />na Negebu na enewu lya ntundu lya lularanda kulawa Soari kugenda Yeriko gweni gushemwa mji gwa mitera ya mitendi. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Ilii ndo isi yanuwalagaliti kwa kukumlapira Iburahimu na Isaka na Yakobu, panongiti, hanishipanani shiyiwuku shaku. Su nikulanguziya guwoni kwa masu gaku, kumbiti hapeni guloki kwingira kulii.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Su, Musa ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa, kahowiti kulii muisi ya Mowabu, gambira Mtuwa ntambu yakatakuliti. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Mtuwa kamfintiriti Musa mulularanda lwa Mowabu, pakwegera na mji gwa Beti Peori, kumbiti mpaka leru kwahera muntu yakavimana lisembi lyakuyi. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Musa kaweriti na umuli wa vinja miya na ishilini pakahowiti, masu gakuyi gaweriti gankuwona weri na kaweriti na makakala gakuyi. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Waisraeli wamdayiliriti Musa mulularanda lwa Mowabu kwa mashaka selesini. Su mashaka ga kudaya na kugonjera shiwembu gaperiti.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Vinu Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni kamemitwi rohu gwa luhala, toziya Musa kamtuliriti mawoku gakuyi. Su Waisraeli wamjimiriti Yoshuwa na kugajimira malagaliru ga Mtuwa gakampananiti Musa.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Hakwenilawiri kayi Muisraeli mbuyi gambira Musa, ulii yakayowiriti sheni kwa sheni na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Kwahera mbuyi gwingi gwa Mlungu yakatenditi mawuzawuza pamuhera na makangashu gambira ilii Mtuwa yakagajegiti kwa Musa gakatendi kulongolu kwa Farao mfalumi gwa isi ya Misri pamuhera na wakulu wayaguyi na isi yoseri. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Kwahera mbuyi gwingi gwa Mlungu yakatenditi mirandu mikulu na vya kutiliziya gambira Musa ntambu yakatenditi kulongolu kwa Waisraeli woseri.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>